<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 SA - Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha keli cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli, mwanduso tsapfikala chitabu chikulu chimwe ichimanyike ka chitabu cha Samweli. Mwanduso ichitabu achino tsachigholighwa kuwa pfitabu pfili mna litoleo ilikemighwe Septuajinti. Alino tsalikala litoleo lya mwanduso lya tafasiri ya Laghano lya Ghumwande mna chilugha cha Chiyunani. Litaghwa lya itafasiri alyo tsalina mana ka itafasiri ayo tsayandikighwa na wanu sabini au sabini na weli wa Chiyahudi iwasomile. Mna itafasiri aino ya Chigiriki, ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli tsapfikemighwa Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli. Mna litoleo lya Chilatini ipfitabu apfo tsapfikemighwa taghwa lingi. Litaghwa alyo tsa Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apfo ipfitabu ipfimanyika leloli ka Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli tsapfikemighwa mna litoleo alyo Wafalume wa kadatu na Wafalume wa kane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli pfolangusa aghala ghayatendile nabii Samweli mna ughima wake, mfalume Sauli, na mfalume Daudi. Samweli yuyo iyatsighile kuwa mfalume ahala isi ya Isiraeli hailawile mna utawala wa Walamtsi na kwanza kutawalighwa na Wafalume.</para>
  <para style="ip">Samweli yuyo iyawabakile mapfuta Sauli na Daudi wawe wafalume wa Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuduhu iyomanya yuhi iyandike pfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli. Imunu iyandike ng'etambule baye mna ipfitabu apfino, lekeni tsa ka mghima mna matsuwa ghose ahala Daudi hayawile mfalume na tsa kamghima mna utawala awo na pfipfila tsakadaha ukwona na ukusoma. Tsibaluwa tsingi itsandike ughima wa Sauli na Samweli. Pfipfila ipfitabu apfino ng'apfimanyika baye ka pfandikighwe tsuwachi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati mwa ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Tsolangusa Daudi pfayawile mfalume wa Yuda na hambele kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli yose. Isura ya 1-5</para>
  <para style="io">Tsolangusa Daudi pfayatawale ka mfalume na kuwahuma maaduwi tsake wengi. Isura ya 6-10</para>
  <para style="io">Twosoma apfila Daudi pfayatendile ughoni na ukukoma na apfila Nasani pfayammanile. Mna isura ya 11-12</para>
  <para style="io">Tsolangusa Daudi apfila pfayalemighwe na iwanu lwa mwanduso na lwa keli. Isura ya 13-20</para>
  <para style="io">Tsolangusa ukumalitsila tsimbuli tsa ughima wa Daudi. Isura ya 22-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kolongelighwa ukufa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sauli hayafile, Daudi na wayaghe tsawoya kulawa kuwatowa Waamaleki, na kakala Sikilagi kwa matsuwa meli. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Tsuwa lya kadatu, munu yumwe kulawa kuna indalo ya Sauli, aku maghwanda ghake kaghadegha kwa usungu, aku kemwaghila timbwisi mwitwi kamghendela Daudi. Hayampfikile Daudi kamghwila hambele hake kamtamanila. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi kamghutsa, “Kwaulawa kwani?” Naye kamwidika, “Nitsuma kulawa kuna indalo ya Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi kamlongela, “Nongele aghala ighalawilile ako.” Imunu ayula kamwidika, “Wanu wengi watsuma kulawa kung'ondo na wengi wakomighwa. Pfipfila Sauli na imwanaghe Yonasani nawo wakomighwa.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi kamghutsa imsongolo ayula, “Umanyiletsa ka Sauli na Yonasani mwanaghe wakomighwa?” <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Imsongolo ayula kamwidika, “Hanili mna ichidunda cha Giliboa, tsanimwona Sauli keghamila mgoha ghwake na mituka ya wadina falasi ing'ali imsoghelela habehi ng'ani. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Sauli hayahunduke kuchisogho, tsakambona kanikema. Na nene nyidika, ‘Oo, na ahano.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Yeye kangutsa, ‘Ghweghwe uli nani?’ Nene nimwidika, ‘Nene na Mmaleki.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Baho kanongela, ‘Seghela habehi unikome kwaapfila wanitowa ng'ani. Lekeni ning'ali mgima.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Apfo nimghendela nimkoma, kwapfila tsanimanya yang'aghwa hasi ng'ohona baye. Kuya nisola litaji alila ilikalile mwitwi mwake na likung'u lili mmoko mwake, pfose nikughalila ghweghwe mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Baho Daudi na iwanu wake waghadegha maghwanda ghawo kwa usungu. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Walila na ukudomboketsa na waleka ukuja mbaka nemihe kwa ukukomighwa kwa Sauli, na Yonasani imwanaghe, na ukukomighwa kwa iwanu wa Waisiraeli, iwali wanu wa IMNDEWA, kwaapfila wanu wengi tsawakomighwa kung'ondo. <verse eid="2SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi kamghutsa imsongolo ayula iyamlongele agho, “Ulawile kwani?” Naye kamwidika, “Nene na Mmaleki, lekeni nokala muisi mwako ka mgheni.” <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi kamghutsa, “Tsayuiletsa ghweghwe ng'upfukile baye kugholosa ghumoko ghwako na kumkoma imunu iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA kwa kubakighwa mapfuta?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Kuya Daudi kamkema msongolo wake yumwe kamlongela, “Mkome imunu ayuno!” Naye imsongolo ayula kamtowa Imuamaleki ayula, naye kafa. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi kalonga, “Ukukomighwa kwako kwiyonza ghumwenyegho, kwaapfila ghweghwe mwenyegho kulonga kwa mlomo ghwako, ‘Nimkoma imunu iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA kwa kubakighwa mapfuta.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kowadomboketsela Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi kawembila Sauli na Yonasani imwanaghe wila wa ukudomboketsa. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Na kalaghitsa iwanu wa Yuda wafundighwe wila auno, nawo wandikighwa mna ichitabu cha Yashari.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Gwe Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">iwanu wighodela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">wakomighwa mna ipfidunda pfako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Lola, iwanu iwadahile ukwitowa pfawakomighwe!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Mleke kuwalongela iwanu wa isi ya Gati imbuli aino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">wala mleke kulalatsa mna tsikaye tsa Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Hela neghe tsawo Wafilisti watsoseka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Na neghe tsawo awo ing'awengile ngoma watsodeng'elela.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Mwemwe pfidunda pfa Giliboa mleke kuwa na tungwe wala mvula mna mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Wala imighunda yenu ileke kwota chinu chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Kwaapfila ako ingawo ya ayula yana ingupfu ighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">ingawo ya Sauli ng'aibakighwe keli mapfuta baye.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Kwa idamu ya awala iwakomighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">na ng'uli tsa awala wana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">imishale ya Yonasani ng'ayuyile hela baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">wala lipanga lya Sauli ng'alyuyile hela baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Liwakoma wanu wengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Ona, liwakoma iwanu iwadahile ukwitowa.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sauli na Yonasani, hawakalile waghima iwanu wawakunda na wawadeng'elela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Tsawakala hamwe, na hawafile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">wafa hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Tsawabewe kubita magengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">ona, tsawana ngupfu ghendo kubita simba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Mwemwe wapinga wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">mlilileni Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Tsakawapfatsa maghwanda madung'u ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">kaghahamba maghwanda ghenu kwa nzahabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Lola iwanu wana ingupfu pfawaghwile kung'ondo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasani kakomighwa mna ipfidunda.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Nokwonela usungu ndughu yangu Yonasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">matsuwa ghose kunikunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">ukunikunda kwako kunikangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">ukunikunda kwako kunikangawatsa kubita iwapinga pfawokunda.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Lola iwanu iwadahile ukwitowa pfawaghwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">na tsisilaha tsawo tsilekighwa, tsahela sang'ano.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kosaghulighwa yawe mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Haghamalile aghano, Daudi kamlomba IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Pfihi ngeluke kuna ghumji ghumwe ghwa isi ya Yuda?” IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Ghenda!” Daudi kamghutsa, “Ng'ende mji ghwachi?” IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Ghenda kuna ghumji ghwa Hebroni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Apfo Daudi kaghenda Hebroni, yeye na wapinga wake weli, Ahinoamu kulawa isi ya Yezireeli, na Abigaili, chitsuka wa Nabali, iyalawile ghumji ghwa Karimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Pfipfila koka na iwanu iyakalile nawo, chila munu na wanu wa kaye yake, nawo tsawakala mna imiji ili mmbalimbali mwa Hebroni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Iwanu wa Yuda wamghendela Daudi ako Hebroni wambaka mapfuta yawe mfalume wawo. Daudi hayahulike ka iwanu wa Yabeshi Gileadi wawo iwamtsikile Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />kawatuma wasenga waghende wakawalongele iwanu wa Yabeshi Gileadi apfino, “IMNDEWA yawabaliki kwaapfila mtenda ghoya kwa kumtsika Sauli mfalume wenu. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />IMNDEWA naye yawatendele uluso na yatogholeke kuna mwemwe. Na nene nitsowatendela ighanoghile kwa aghano ghamtendile. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Lelo mgangamale na mleke kutenyuka. Mfalume wenu Sauli kafa na iwanu wa Yuda wanisaghula nene na kunibaka mapfuta niwe mfalume wawo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti kosaghulighwa kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineri mwana wa Neri, mkulu wa maasikali wa Sauli tsakamsola Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli kamghala ako Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Ako, Abineri kamtenda Ishibosheti yawe mfalume wa Gileadi, Ashuru, Yezireeli, Efraimu, Benjamini na isi yose ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti hayanduse kuitawala Isiraeli tsakana miyaka alubaini, naye tsakatawala kwa miyaka mili. Lekeni likabila lya Yuda tsalimuwinza Daudi ka mfalume wawo. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi tsakawa mfalume wa likabila lya Yuda kwa miyaka saba na miyetsi sita, ukaye yake tsa ako Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Isiraeli na iwanu wa Yuda wetowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineri mwana wa Neri, hamwe na iwakulu wa Ishibosheti, imwana wa Sauli tsawalawa Mahanaimu waghenda Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana wa Seruya na watumighwa wangi wa Daudi, nawo walawa wetingana na Abineri na iwanu iyakalile nawo habehi na tsimbu ilili ako Gibeoni. Nawo wakala hasi, wangi kumwambu akuno kwa litsimbu, na wangi kumwambu akula. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineri kamlongela Yoabu, “Waleke iwasongolo wetowe hambele hetu!” Yoabu kamlongela, “Pfinogha.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Apfo wasoghela hambele wasongolo kumi na weli wa likabila lya Benjamini wa Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli, na wasongolo kumi na weli wa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Chila yumwe kamghogha mwitwi iyetowa naye, kamhoma kwa lipanga mlubapfu, apfo iwasongolo wose weli waghwa hasi wafa. Apfo hanu hao hakemighwa Helikati Hazurimu, ako Gibeoni, mana yake, “Mghunda ghwa mapanga.”<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Litsuwa alila tsawetowa ng'ani. Abineri na iwanu wa Isiraeli watowighwa ng'ani na iwanu wa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Iwana wadatu wa Seruya, Yoabu, Abishai na Asaheli tsawabahala. Asaheli yang'ali yotsuma ka dondolo. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaheli kamuwinga Abineri na ng'ahunduke baye kumoso wala kujilo. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abineri hayahunduke kuchisogho na kumwona Asaheli, kamghutsa, “Pfihi ghweghwe kwa Asaheli?” Asaheli kamwidika, “Ona, nene.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Kuya Abineri kamlongela, “Leka kuniwinga, hunduka umghoghe msongolo yumwe umboke tsisilaha tsake.” Lekeni Abineri ng'alekile baye kumuwinga.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abineri kamlongela keli Asaheli, “Leka kuniwinzilitsa! Hebali nikukome? Angu ichihanga changu nitsochika kwani hambele ha ndughu yako Yoabu?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Lekeni Asaheli kalema kuhunduka. Apfo Abineri kamhoma munda chisengele nyuma na mgoha, na ghumgoha agho ghumlawila Asaheli kumghongo. Asaheli kaghwa hasi, na bahala kafa. Iwanu wose hawapfikile hanu hayafilile Asaheli wema.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Lekeni Yoabu na Abishai wamuwinza Abineri. Litsuwa haling'ali litsama tsawapfika mna ichidunda cha Ama, ichili ubali wa mashaliki wa Gia mna inzila ighendile mna inyika ya Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Benjamini tsawetingana, hamwe na Abineri, na wakala kingili limwe nawo tsawema mchidando. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Baho Abineri kamkemelela Yoabu, “Apfi twitsetowa ghamatsuwa ghose? Angu ng'aukwona baye ka kwatutsighila kuna usungu? Angu tsuwachi utsowalaghitsa iwanu wako waleke kuwawinzilitsa ndughu tsawo?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu kamwidika, “Nelaha kwa Imulungu yana mgima, ung'alekile kulonga mbuli aino, iwanu wangu wang'aghendelele ghendo kuwawinzilitsa ndughu tsawo mbaka ilupfi nemitondo.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Apfo Yoabu katowa malati, baho iwanu wose waleka kuwawinzilitsa Waisiraeli, wala ng'awetowile keli baye.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Chilo chose Abineri na iwanu wake tsawaluta mna ulwanda wa Araba. Tsawaloka ghumto Yoridani, wanga isi yose ya Bitironi mbaka wapfika Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu hayoile kumuwinzilitsa Abineri, kawatinganitsa iwanu wake wose, na katanga ka wanu kumi na tisa wa Daudi ng'awali baho baye, ung'aleka kumpeta Asaheli.<verse eid="2SA 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Lekeni wanu wa Daudi wawakoma wanu miya ndatu na sitini wa Abineri, iwalawile mna likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na iwanu wake walusola ilukuli lwa Asaheli, walutsika mna likabuli lya aba wake, lili Betilehemu. Yoabu na iwanu wake wanga chilo chose, na hakuchele wapfika Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Iwanu wa Sauli na iwanu wa Daudi tsawetowa kwa matsuwa mengi. Ingupfu tsayongetseka na kongetseka kwa iwanu wa Daudi. Lekeni iwanu wa Sauli waghendelela kuwa nyonde nyonde.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wamale wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Awano wawo iwana wa Daudi iwelekighwe ako Hebroni: mwanaghe chaudele tsakakemighwa Amnoni, mai wake yang'ali yokemighwa Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />mwanaghe wa keli tsakakemighwa Kileabu, mai wake yang'ali yokemighwa Abigaili, ichitsuka wa Nabali kulawa Karimeli, mwanaghe wa kadatu tsakakemighwa Abusalomu, mai wake yang'ali yokemighwa Maaka imwana wa Talimai mfalume wa Geshuri, <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />mwanaghe wa kane tsakakemighwa Adoniya, mai wake tsakakemighwa Hagiti, imwanaghe wa tano tsakakemighwa Shefatia, mai wake yang'ali yokemighwa Abitali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />na imwanaghe wa sita tsakakemighwa Itireamu, mai wake yang'ali yokemighwa Egila, mwehe wake Daudi. Wehe tsake Daudi tsawamwelekela iwana awano wose hayali ako Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineri kelunga na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Iwanu wa Daudi na iwanu wa Sauli hawang'ali woghendelela ukwitowa, Abineri tsakawa na ngupfu ng'ani mna iwanu wa Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli tsakana pinga mdodo iyakemighwe Risipa, neghe Aya. Lelo tsuwa limwe Ishibosheti kamghutsa Abineri, “Hebali uwasile na pinga wa aba wangu?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineri kaghudubuka kwa aghala ghayalongile Ishibosheti, kalonga, “Apfi kwakwalangula nene nodaha kumbiduka Sauli na kuwa ubali wa Yuda? Lola, nene nowatendela ghanoghile ikaye ya aba wako Sauli, ndughu tsake, sale tsake na sikwikile baye mna ghamoko gha Daudi mbaka leloli. Hata apfo leloli kombona ka nene nina totso kwa ipinga ayo! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Imulungu yandiye ka sighatendile aghala ghose ghayamwilahile Daudi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Imulungu tsakamwilahila Daudi ka katsousola ufalume wa Sauli na kumwing'a yeye. Naye katsotawala Isiraeli na Yuda kulawa Dani mbaka Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti ng'amwidike keli baye Abineri kwaapfila tsakampfuka.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Kuya Abineri kawatuma wasenga kwa Daudi ako Hebroni, wakamlongele, “Angu nani iyatsotawala isi aino? Wilaghane na nene, na nene nitsokwapfila kuitenda Isiraeli iwe yako.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi kamwidika, “Pfinogha. Nitsotenda laghano na ghweghwe. Ila nokulomba chinu chimwe: Ahala hautsakutsa kumbona, uleke kutsa mbaka unighalile Mikali neghe Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Kuya Daudi kawatuma wasenga kwa Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli kalonga, “Mbuyitsile pinga wangu Mikali yanimkwelile kwa mali ya magopfi miya gha Wafilisti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Baho Ishibosheti kawatuma wanu wakamsole Mikali kulawa kwa mmale wake Palitieli imwana wa Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Lekeni Palitieli kaghenda hamwe na ipinga wake aku kolila mnzila mbaka ako Bahurimu. Abineri kamlongela Palitieli, “Uye ukaye.” Naye koya.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineri kaghenda kuna wapfilongotsi wa Isiraeli, kawalongela, “Kwa matsuwa mengi ighapfosile mng'ali mbama Daudi yawe mfalume wenu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Lelo muighale hatselu imbuli ayo kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Daudi apfino, ‘Kwa kubitila Daudi mtumighwa wangu, nitsowakombola iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli kulawa mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti na kulawa mna awala wose iwowehila.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Pfipfila Abineri kalonga na iwanu wa likabila lya Benjamini, kuya kaghenda mbaka Hebroni kumlongela Daudi aghala ghawelaghane ukutenda iwanu wose wa Isiraeli na kabila lyose lya Benjamini.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineri hayamghendele Daudi, tsakana wanu ishilini, naye Daudi kawatendela chihungo cha ipfijo. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abineri kamlongela Daudi, “Lelo nene nitsoghenda nikakughalile wanu wose wa Isiraeli, ghweghwe mndewa wangu mfalume. Watsakutsa mwilaghane, ili uwe mfalume wawo, naghwe kutsowatawala wose ka pfubama.” Baho Daudi kamuwagha Abineri, naye koka tseghamba.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineri kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Hambele, Yoabu na iwanu wangi wa Daudi woya kulawa kung'ondo, waghala pfinu pfingi pfawabokile. Lekeni Abineri tsa ng'ali hamwe baye na Daudi ako Hebroni, kwaapfila Daudi tsakamuwagha koka, naye Abineri koka tseghamba. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu hayoile na maasikali wake, kalongelighwa ka Abineri mwana wa Neri tsakatsa kumwona mfalume Daudi, naye kamuwagha yoke, naye koka tseghamba. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu kamghendela mfalume kamlongela, “Lelo utendile choni? Abineri katsa kuna ghweghwe, lelo heule umlekile yoke? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Ghweghwe kommanya ghoya Abineri mwana wa Neri, miyagho katsa kukubugha, katsa yamanye pfaukala, na chila chinu chautenda.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu hayamlekile Daudi, kawatuma wasenga wakamuyitse Abineri, nawo wampfika kuna ichisima cha Sira na wambweletsa, lekeni Daudi tsang'amanyile baye ichinu acho.<verse eid="2SA 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineri hayoile Hebroni, Yoabu kamsola hambalimbali ha lilango kwaapfila tsaketenda ka kobama yalonge naye chinyele. Kuya Yoabu kamuhoma munda Abineri, kwaapfila tsakamkoma ndughu yake Asaheli, naye kafa. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Hambele Daudi hayahulike tsimbuli atso kalonga, “Nene na ufalume wangu twahela totso hambele ha IMNDEWA kwa ukukomighwa kwa Abineri mwana wa Neri. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Na yahighighwe Yoabu na ikaye yose ya aba wake! Ikaye ya Yoabu matsuwa ghose ileke kukala bila munu yana utamu wa chisonono, au ukoma, au yoghendela ng'weku, au yokomighwa kwa lipanga, au yalihela chijo!”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na ndughu yake Abishai wamkoma Abineri kwaapfila tsakamkoma ndughu yawo Asaheli mng'ondo ako Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineri kotsikighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Kuya mfalume Daudi kamlongela Yoabu na iwanu wose iwakalile hamwe naye wadeghe maghwanda ghao, wapfale maghunila wamlilile Abineri. Ichipindi cha ukutsika, mfalume Daudi yang'ali yoghenda kuchughu kwa lijenetsa.<verse eid="2SA 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abineri katsikighwa ako Hebroni, na mfalume katula ndilo mmbalimbali mwa likabuli, kuya iwanu wangi nawo watenda pfipfo. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mfalume kamlila Abineri kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">“Tsayuiletsa Abineri yafe ka mbotsi?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Ghamoko ghako ng'aghohighwe baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Na ghamaghulu ghako ng'aghohighwe baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Tsakufa ka imunu yakomighwe na iwanu wehile!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Na iwanu wose wongetsa ukumlilila.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Kuya iwanu wose waghenda kumlongela Daudi yaje chighate kung'ali misi. Lekeni Daudi kelaha kalonga, “Imulungu yandiye ka nitsakuja chighate au chinu chochose ng'ana litsuwa liswe!” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Iwanu wose waghona agho, apfo tsawatoghola chila chinu chayatendile mfalume pfachiwanoghele. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Apfo mna litsuwa alyo, Waisiraeli wose wamanya ka mfalume Daudi ng'abamile baye kumkoma Abineri mwana wa Neri. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Mfalume Daudi kawalongela watumighwa wake, “Apfi ng'ammanya baye ka leloli munu mkulu na yomanyika ng'ani kafa mna isi ya Isiraeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Hata ka mnibaka mapfuta niwe mfalume, lekeni leloli nene nitenyuka. Na iwana awano wa Seruya nene siwadaha baye. IMNDEWA yawahighe kwa ghamatendo ghawo ghehile ghawatendile.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli hayahulike Abineri kakomighwa ako Hebroni, katenyuka ghumoyo na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wengilighwa na wogha. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli, tsakana wanu weli iwali wakulu wa makingili gha wabapfi, yumwe tsakakemighwa Baana na yungi tsakakemighwa Rekabu. Wose weli tsawana wa Rimoni, imunu wa likabila lya Benjamini iyalawile mna ghumji ghwa Beeroti. Ghumji ghwa Beeroti pfipfila tsaghukala mji ghwa wanu wa kabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Iwanu wa Beeroti tsawatsumila Gitaimu na wokala ako mbaka leloli.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonasani mwana wa Sauli, tsakana mwana yaholole maghulu ghose meli, imwana ayo tsakakemighwa Mefibosheti. Mefibosheti tsakana miyaka mitano ahala tsimbuli tsa ukufa kwa Sauli na Yonasani hatsipfikile kulawa Yezireeli. Ipinga iyang'ali yomlela hayahulike Sauli na Yonasani wakomighwa ako Yezireeli, kamsola Mefibosheti katsuma naye. Lekeni hayang'ali yotsuma naye himahima, imwana ayo kaghwa, kawa chimbete.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Rekabu na Baana, iwana wa Rimoni iyolawila Beeroti, waghenda ukaye kwa Ishibosheti. Wapfika ako nemisi, Ishibosheti hayang'ali yobwihila ukaye yake. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Wengila mng'anda watenda ka wobama kusola ngano, wampfika Ishibosheti kawasa mlusatsi mna ichiheleto chake, wamuhoma mgoha munda. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Hawengile mng'anda kwayawasile Ishibosheti mlusatsi, wamkoma, wamgana litwi lyake, kuya Rekabu na Baana watsuma woka nalyo chilo chose kwa nzila ya Araba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Kuya wamghalila mfalume Daudi litwi lya Ishibosheti ako Hebroni, wamlongela mfalume Daudi, “Alino ahano litwi lya Ishibosheti, mwana wa Sauli, iaduwi wako iyabamile kukukoma. Leloli ghwe mkululu wangu mfalume, IMNDEWA kamliha Sauli na watsukulu wake kwa aghala ghayakutendele.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Lekeni Daudi kawedika Rekabu na Baana, iwana wa Rimoni, imunu wa Beeroti, “Nelaha kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA iyali mgima, yeye iyanikombole mna ghamadununziko ghose! <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Imunu ayula iyatsile kunongela ako Sikilagi, ka Sauli kafa, tsakaghamba ka kongalila mbuli inoghile, nimghogha na kumkoma. Acho chicho chanimghwekile kwa tsimbuli tsake tsayangalile! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Lelo imunu yehile yang'amkoma imunu yanoghile mng'anda mwake na mna ilusatsi lwake, pfihi ng'apfinoghile baye na nene nimkome naye yahupe muisi?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Daudi kawalaghitsa asikali wake, wawakoma Rekabu na Baana. Wawagana ghamoko ghawo na ghamaghulu ghawo na wakondeka ng'uli tsawo mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu lili Hebroni. Lekeni walisola litwi lya Ishibosheti walitsika mna likabuli lya Abineri ako Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kakuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-14:1">1 Mmats 11:1-9–14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Kuya iwanu wa makabila ghose gha Isiraeli wamghendela Daudi ako Hebroni wamlongela, “Lola, twetwe twa ndughu tsako ghendo. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Ghumwande, Sauli hayang'ali mfalume wetu, ghweghwe yuyo yuwalongotse Waisiraeli mng'ondo, na IMNDEWA tsakakulongela, ‘Kutsakuwa mdimi wa iwanu wangu Isiraeli na kutsakuwa mkulu wawo.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Apfo, ipfilongotsi wose wa Isiraeli wamghendela mfalume Daudi ako Hebroni, naye keka nawo laghano hambele ha IMNDEWA, kuya wambaka mapfuta Daudi kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi tsakana miyaka selasini hayawile mfalume, naye katawala kwa miyaka alubaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ako Hebroni Daudi katawala isi ya Yuda kwa miyaka saba na miyetsi sita, na ako Yerusalemu kawatawala iwanu wa Isiraeli hamwe na iwanu wa Yuda kwa miyaka selasini na midatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Tsuwa limwe mfalume Daudi na iwanu wake waghenda Yerusalemu kuwatowa Wayebusi, wenyekaye iwakalile mumo. Wayebusi wamlongela, “Ng'autsakwingila baye mna ghumji aghuno, kwaapfila hata pfifita na pfimbete watsokuwinga.” Wamlongela apfo kwaapfila tsawaghamba Daudi tsang'odaha baye ukwingila amwo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Lekeni mfalume Daudi kaiboka ingome lya Siyoni, mana yake mji ghwa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Litsuwa alila, Daudi kawalongela iwanu wake, “Munu wowose iyatsowatowa Wayebusi kobamighwa yang'e mna ichikolongo achino cha ghamatsi yawatowe ‘pfimbete na pfifita,’ awo muhe wangu kowahila.” Achi chicho ichiwatenda iwanu walonge, “Pfifita na pfimbete ng'awatsakwingila mng'anda baye.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi tsakakala mna ingome ayo, naye kaghukema ghumji aghwo “Mji ghwa Daudi.” Daudi kaghutsenga ghumji agho kwa kughutsunguluka, kandusila Milo mbaka mng'anda. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Naye Daudi tsakongotseka ng'ani kuwa na tsingupfu, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu yana ingupfu tsakahamwe naye.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Kuya, mfalume Hiramu wa Tiro kawatuma wasenga waghende kwa Daudi. Pfipfila kamghalila imibiki ya mieletsi, iwanu iwosongola mibiki na iwanu iwotsenga, awo wamtsengela Daudi ing'anda ya chifalume. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Apfo Daudi kamanya ka IMNDEWA kamtenda yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli, na kautenda ufalume wake ukule kwa iwanu wake wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi hayalawile Hebroni na kupfika Yerusalemu, kuko kongetsa kukwela wehe wengi na kongetsa kusola pfimada wengi. Nawo wamwelekela Daudi wana wengi wamale na wapinga. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aghano ghagho ghamataghwa gha iwana wamale wa Daudi iwelekighwe Yerusalemu: Shamua, Shobabu, Natani, Selemani, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibihari, Elishua, Nefegi, Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama, Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kowahuma Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Mmats 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Wafilisti hawahulike Daudi kabakighwa mapfuta yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli, maasikali wose waghenda kumbama, lekeni Daudi tsakahulika ka wombama, kahulumka kaghenda kwipfisa kuna ingome. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Wafilisti tsawapfika na wenela mna lwanda lwose lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Apfo Daudi kamghutsa IMNDEWA, “Apfi ng'ende kuwatowa Wafilisti? Pfihi kutsonyapfila niwahume?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Naye IMNDEWA kamwidika Daudi, “Ghenda ukawatowe kwaapfila nitsokutenda uwahume ghendo.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Apfo Daudi kapfika Baali Perasimu kawatowa Wafilisti, kuya kalonga, “IMNDEWA kapfosa haghatighati ha maaduwi tsangu ka ghumto ighumemile ighuduma.” Apfo hanu aho hakemighwa Baali Perasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Wafilisti tsawapfileka pfinyagho pfao pfa imilungu yawo hanu hao, naye Daudi na iwanu wake wapfisola ipfinyagho apfo.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Wafilisti tsawoya keli na wenela mna ulwanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi kamlomba IMNDEWA, naye kamlongela, “Uleke kuwatowa kulawa ahano, ila ughende kuchughu kwao na uwatowe hambele ha imibiki ya mififi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Hautsohulika pfisindo pfa iwanu iwogunda mchanya mwa imififi ayo, ughende himahima kwaapfila acho chitsakuwa chitango ka nolongola kuwatowa maasikali wa Wafilisti.”<verse eid="2SA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi katenda ka pfayalaghitsighwe na IMNDEWA, naye kawatowa Wafilisti kulawa Geba mbaka Gezeri.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku lya laghano lyoghalighwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Mmats 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25">1 Mmats 15:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:6-43">1 Mmats 16:6-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daudi kawakema keli maasikali iwadahile ukwitowa pfinoghile mna Isiraeli, nawo tsawapfika elufu selasini. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi hamwe na iwanu wake waghenda Baala Yuda, kulisola lisanduku lya laghano ilikemighwa kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA yana ingupfu, iyokala mna chighubiko cha lisanduku lya lilaghano ichili haghati ha wapfilumbe iwana ghamabawa iwakemighwe makelubi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Apfo walisola lisanduku lya IMNDEWA kulawa mna ing'anda ya Abinadabu ili mchidunda, walidinitsa mna ghumtuka ghwa sambi ghwa ukukweghighwa. Uza na Ahio iwana wa Abinadabu wang'ali woghwendesa ghumtuka aghwo, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />ighudutile lisanduku alyo lya Imulungu, naye Ahio tsakalongola hambele ha lisanduku alyo. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, wang'ali wakwimba na kubigha kwa ngupfu tsawo tsose hambele ha IMNDEWA. Tsawatowa pfilimba, pfimbeta, pfigoma, keyamba na matari.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Hawapfikile kuna ichibwalu cha ukubetela ingano cha Nakoni, Uza kagholosa ghumoko ghwake kalikinda lisanduku lya Imulungu, kwaapfila wang'ombe awala tsawekwala. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Baho IMNDEWA kamghudubukila Uza. Apfo Imulungu kamkoma Uza, na bahala Uza kafa hambalimbali ha lisanduku lya Imulungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Naye Daudi tsakona usungu kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamghudubukila Uza kamkoma. Apfo hanu aho hokemighwa Peresi Uza mbaka leloli.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Litsuwa alyo Daudi kampfuka IMNDEWA kalonga, “Lelo lisanduku lya IMNDEWA litsopfikatse kuna nene?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Apfo, Daudi kaleka ukulighala lisanduku lya IMNDEWA mna ghumji ghwa Daudi, ila kalighala ukaye kwa Obedi Edomu, imunu wa ghumji ghwa Gati. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisanduku alyo lya IMNDEWA tsalikala ukaye kwa Obedi Edomu kwa miyetsi midatu, naye IMNDEWA kambaliki Obedi Edomu, iwanu wa ikaye yake, na chila chinu chayenacho.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Mfalume Daudi hayahulike ka IMNDEWA kawabaliki iwanu wa ikaye ya Obedi Edomu na pfinu pfose pfayali napfo kwaapfila kana sanduku lya Imulungu, kaghenda kulisola lisanduku lya laghano ukaye kwa Obedi Edomu kalighala mna ghumji ghwa Daudi kwa ukudeng'elela. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Iwanu awala iwalighalile lisanduku lya IMNDEWA chila hawaghendile maghulu sita, Daudi kalapfa nambiko, kalapfa ng'ombe yumwe na ndama iyanenehe. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi kabigha kwa ngupfu tsake tsose hambele ha IMNDEWA, aku keyoha chitsibao cha mtambika. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Apfo, Daudi na Waisiraeli wose walihilika lisanduku lya IMNDEWA kwa ukudeng'elela na kwa kutowa tsimalati.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Lisanduku lya IMNDEWA haling'ali likwingila mna ghumji ghwa Daudi, Mikali neghe Sauli kasungulila mdilisha, kamwona mfalume Daudi kodalukadaluka na kubigha hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye kambetsa mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Kuya walighala lisanduku lya IMNDEWA mna lihema ilitindimikighwe na Daudi na kulika hanu hake. Naye Daudi kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba hambele ha IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2SA 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi hayamalitse ukulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na tsa ukukala tseghamba, kawabaliki iwanu kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA yana ingupfu ng'ani, <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />na kamgholela chila munu mna ghumtingano ghose ghwa Waisiraeli, wamale kwa wapinga, chila yumwe chighate, chitomo cha nyama na chighate cha nzabibu. Kuya iwanu wose woka, chila munu koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi hayoile ukaye yake ili yawabaliki iwanu wake, Mikali neghe Sauli, kaghenda kumbokela, kalonga, “Lola, mfalume wa Isiraeli pfayatunyighwe leloli! Kepambula ghamaghwanda hambele ha iwatumighwa wake mapinga na iwamale, ka imunu mbotsi pfayotsula maghwanda ghake hambele ha iwanu bila kwona chinyala!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi kamlongela Mikali, “Ning'ali nimbighila IMNDEWA, iyanisaghule nene na kumleka aba wako na iwanu wa ilukolo lwake, yeye kanenda niwe mkulu wa iwanu wake wa Isiraeli. Apfo nitsoghendelela kubigha hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Nitsehulumsa kubita sambi. Ghweghwe kwombona si chinu baye, lekeni iwatumighwa mapinga awala yaulongile watsonitoghola.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Apfo Mikali neghe Sauli ng'eleke mwana baye mbaka kafa.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Nasani kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Mmats 17:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Mfalume Daudi hayakalile mna ing'anda yake ya ufalume, IMNDEWA kamtenda yakale tseghamba na maaduwi wake wose. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Kuya mfalume Daudi kamlongela nabii Nasani, “Lola nene nokala mna ing'anda itsengighwe na mibiki ya mikataluba, lekeni lisanduku lya Imulungu lya mna lihema!” <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Nasani kamwidika, “Utende chochose chubama, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kahamwe naghwe.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Lekeni ichilo chicho IMNDEWA kamlongela Nasani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Ghenda ukamlongele mtumighwa wangu Daudi, IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Angu ghweghwe kutsonitsengela nene ing'anda ya ukukala? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Tangiya litsuwa alila haniwakombole iwanu wa Isiraeli kulawa Misiri mbaka leloli, sikalile baye mng'anda. Nyanga chila hanu na ning'ali nikala mna lihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Hanu hohose hanighendile na iwanu wa Isiraeli, angu tsanimlongela mkulu wowose iyanimtumile yawalongotse Waisiraeli, heule ng'unitsengele baye ng'anda itsengighwe na mibiki ya mikataluba?’ <verse eid="2SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Lelo umlongele mtumighwa wangu Daudi: Nene IMNDEWA nina ingupfu ng'ani nolonga apfino, ‘Tsanikulapfa kumghina haung'ali udima wang'olo, nikusaghula uwe mkulu wa iwanu wangu Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Tangiya matsuwa aghala tsanikala hamwe naghwe kokose kwaughendile, na niwakoma awala wose iwokuhila hambele hako. Na nene nitsolitenda taghwa lyako limanyike ka pfaghali mataghwa gha pfilongotsi wangi wakulu iwali muisi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Nene nitsowasaghulila iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli hanu ha ukukala, watsokala hanu hao wenyegho, kuduhu keli imunu yatsowatsupfa. Nawo maaduwi wana tsingupfu ng'awatsowadununza keli ka ghumwande, tangiya haniwasaghule walamtsi wawalongotse iwanu wangu Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />Nene nitsokukinga na maaduwi tsako wose. Kubita agho ghose, IMNDEWA kokulongela ka katsokutsengela ng'anda. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Hautsakufa na ukwilunga na iwabala wako, nitsomtenda yumwe wa iwanagho yawe mfalume, na nitsoutenda ufalume wake uwe na ngupfu. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Yeye yuyo iyatsonitsengela nene ing'anda, na ufalume wake utsoghendelela matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nene nitsakuwa aba wake, naye katsakuwa mwanangu. Yang'atenda ghehile, nitsomfapula ka iwanu pfawowafapula iwana wawo kwa mbalati. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Lekeni sitsoleka baye kumwonela libatsi ka pfandekile kumwonela libatsi Sauli yanimlapfile hambele hako. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Ikaya yako na ufalume wako pfitsokala matsuwa ghose. Chighoda chako cha ufalume chitsokala matsuwa ghose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nasani kamlongela Daudi aghala ghose ghayalangusighwe na Imulungu mna ghamaono agho.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kolomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Mmats 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Kuya mfalume Daudi kengila mng'anda, kakala hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye kalomba, “Angu nene nili nani, ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wangu, na kaye yangu choni mbaka kunyinula ahano hanili leloli? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, alino lyoneka dodo ghendo hambele hako, lekeni kughendelela kulonga ka kutsowatendela makulu iwanu wa ikaye yangu mna imiyaka mingi ikutsa. Kumbe apfino pfipfo pfauwatendela iwanu, ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu! <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Lelo nikulongele choni, nene Daudi mtumighwa wako? Mana ghweghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wangu, kwonimanya nene mtumighwa wako. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ka pfaulongile na ka pfaubamile mwenyegho, ghweghwe kutenda makulu agho ghose ili unangulitse nene mtumighwa wako. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Kwa aghala ghatuhulike, ghweghwe IMNDEWA kwa mkulu, kuduhu iyali ka ghweghwe, na kuduhu Imulungu ka ghweghwe. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kuduhu wanu muisi iwodaha kwighala na iwanu wako Waisiraeli. Ghweghwe tsakughenda kuwakombola kulawa Misiri ili wawe wanu wako. Kulitenda taghwa lyako limanyike na kuwatendela mbuli ng'ulu na tsa ukukangawatsa. Tsakuwawinga iwanu wa isi tsingi na milungu yawo ahala iwanu wako hawang'ali wosoghela hambele na kuwaleka iwanu wako yauwakombole Misiri wabite. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Kuweng'a ngupfu iwanu wako wa Isiraeli matsuwa ghose, naghwe IMNDEWA kuwa Imulungu wawo.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Lelo, Ghwe IMNDEWA, ughatende aghala ghaunongele nene mtumighwa wako na iwanu wangu ka pfaulongile. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Na taghwa lyako litunyighwe matsuwa ghose, nawo iwanu watsolonga, ‘IMNDEWA yane ngupfu ng'ani yuyo Imulungu wa Isiraeli!’ Na ikaye ya Daudi mtumighwa wako itsakuwa na ngupfu hambele hako. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Mana ghweghwe Imulungu yuna ngupfu ng'ani, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kunighubulila nene mtumighwa wako, kulonga, ‘Nitsokutsengela ng'anda,’ apfo nolomba bila ukupfuka hambele hako.<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Lelo ghweghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, ghweghwe yuyo Imulungu, na malonga ghako gholongesa, na ghweghwe mwenyegho kulonga kutsonitendela nene mtumighwa wako imbuli aino inoghile. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Apfo nokulomba uwabaliki iwanu wangu nene mtumighwa wako wakale matsuwa ghose hambele hako, kwaapfila ghweghwe tsakulonga apfo, na kwa tsibalaka tsako iwanu wangu watsobalikighwa matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Daudi wohuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Mmats 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Haghamalile agho, mfalume Daudi kawatowa na kawahuma Wafilisti. Kaghusola ghumji ghwa Metegi Ama kulawa mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Kuya kawahuma Wamoabu. Kawawasitsa hasi mna misululo, kawalinga kwa lutsabi. Chila iyawalingile utali wa ilutsabi mala mbili, iwanu awo kawakoma, na awala iyawalingile mala lumwe kwa utali wa ilutsabi alwo kawaleka wagima. Apfo Wamoabu wawa watumighwa wa Daudi na wang'ali womliha kodi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Pfipfila Daudi hayang'ali mnzila koghenda kuyuitsa isi ili habehi na ghumto ghwa Efurate iwe yake keli, kamtowa Hadadezeri imwana wa Rehobu, mfalume wa Soba. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi kamboka wadina falasi wake elufu imwe na miya saba na masikali iwoghenda kwa maghulu elufu ishirini. Kuya Daudi kawaghana nyughe tsa mmaghulu falasi wose wa mituka ya ukukweghighwa, ila kawaleka falasi miya imwe iwokwegha mituka. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Waaramu wa Damasko hawaghendile kumwapfila Hadadezeri, mfalume wa Soba, Daudi kawakoma Waaramu elufu ishilini na weli.<verse eid="2SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Kuya Daudi tsakeka ndalo tsa maasikali mna ghumji ghwa Waaramu wa Damasko. Apfo Waaramu tsawawa watumighwa wake na wang'ali womliha kodi. IMNDEWA kamtenda Daudi yahume kokose kwayaghendile. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi tsakatsisola tsingawo tsa nzahabu tsawaghalile wakulu wa maasikali wa Hadadezeri katsighala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Pfipfila kasola shaba nyingi kulawa mna imiji ya Beta na Berotai, imiji ya Hadadezeri.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Mfalume Toi wa Hamati, hayaulike Daudi kawahuma maasikali wose wa Hadadezeri, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />kamtuma Yoramu imwanaghe kwa mfalume Daudi yakamlamse, kwaapfila tsaketowa na Hadadezeri na kumuhuma. Kwaapfila Hadadezeri tsaketowa na Toi mala nyingi. Yoramu kamghalila nzawadi tsa pfinu pfa fetsa, nzahabu na shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Tsinzawadi atso, hamwe na ifetsa na inzahabu tsayasolile mna tsiisi tsose tsatsitowile, katsilapfa tsiwe tsa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2SA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Tsiisi atso tsitso atsino: Edomu, Moabu, Amoni, Filistia, Amaleki, hamwe na pfinu pfasolile kwa mfalume Hadadezeri, mwana wa Rehobu mfalume wa Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Ukumanyika kwa Daudi tsakongetseka ng'ani. Hayang'ali yakuya ahala hayalawile kumtowa Hadadezeri, tsakawakoma Waedomu elufu kumi na nane mna Lwanda lwa Munyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Daudi keka ndalo ya maasikali mna isi yose ya Edomu. Nawo Waedomu wose wawa watumighwa wake. IMNDEWA kamtenda Daudi yawahume iwanu kokose kwayaghendile.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Apfo Daudi tsakatawala Isiraeli yose, tsakalamla iwanu wake wose watendelighwe ka pfaibamighwa na bila kubaghula munu baye. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana wa Seruya, tsa mkulu wa maasikali. Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi, yang'ali yakwandikagha aghala ighalawile ili ghaleke ukusemwighwa. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana wa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana wa Abiatari wawo tsa watambika, Seraya yeye tsa mwandishi. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada tsa mkulu wa Wakereti na Wapeleti, nawo iwana wa Daudi wakala wakulu iwomwapfilagha mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Tsuwa limwe, Daudi kaghutsa, “Angu hana munu wowose iyasighale mgima mna kaye ya Sauli? Ka kabaho, nobama nimtendele ghanoghile kwaajili ya Yonasani.”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Tsahana mtumighwa yumwe ukaye kwa Sauli iyakemighwe Siba. Naye tsakakemighwa yaghende kwa Daudi. Mfalume Daudi kamghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe kwa Siba?” Naye kamwidika, “Ona, nene na yuyo mtumighwa wako.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Hana munu wowose iyasighale mgima ukaye kwa Sauli? Ka kabaho nobama nimtendele uluso wa Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba kamwidika, “Kabaho mwana wa Yonasani, lekeni yeye chimbete.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Yalikwani?” Siba kamwidika, “Ka ukaye kwa Makiri mwana wa Amieli ako Lo Debari.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Apfo mfalume Daudi kawatuma wanu wakamsole, naye kaghalighwa kulawa ukaye kwa Makiri mwana wa Amieli ako Lo Debari.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Apfo Mefibosheti mwana wa Yonasani, mtsukukulu wa Sauli kaghenda kwa mfalume, kenama mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi hambele ha mfalume Daudi. Daudi kamkema, “Mefibosheti.” Naye kamwidika, “Oo! Nene ahano mtumighwa wako.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka. Nene nitsokutendela uluso kwaajili ya aba wako Yonasani. Nitsokuyitsila imighunda yose ya sekulu wako Sauli. Naghwe kutsakuja na nene matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti kenama mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi, kuya kalonga, “Nene na yumbwa yafile, heule unitendele apfino?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Kuya mfalume Daudi kamkema Siba mtumighwa wa Sauli, kamlongela, “Ipfinu pfose pfikalile pfa Sauli na kaye yake, nimwing'a mtsukulu wa mkulu wako. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Ghweghwe na iwanagho na watumighwa wako mtsomlimila Mefibosheti na mtsomghalila mapfuno ili mtsukulu wa mkulu wako yawe na chijo matsuwa ghose. Lekeni yeye katsakuja na nene.” Ghamatsuwa agho, Siba tsakana wana wamale kumi na watano na watumighwa ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Kuya Siba kamlongela mfalume, “Nene mtumighwa wako, nitsotenda ghose ka pfaulongile.” Apfo Mefibosheti yang'ali yakujagha na Daudi ka yumwe wa iwana wa mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti tsakana mwana mdodo mmale iyakemighwe Mika. Iwanu wa kaye ya Siba tsawawa watumighwa wa Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Apfo Mefibosheti, chimbete yang'ali yokala Yerusalemu na ukuja na mfalume matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowahuma Waamoni na Waashuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Mmats 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Hambele chidogho mfalume Nahasi kafa, na mwanage iyakemighwe Hanuni kawa mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Imfalume Daudi kalonga, “Nitsomtendela Hanuni uluso, imwana wa Nahashi ka aba wake pfayanitendele nene.” Apfo Daudi kawatuma wasenga wakamkanze Hanuni. Nawo wasenga wa Daudi hawapfikile mna isi ya Waamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />wakulu wa Waamoni wamlongela mkulu wawo Hanuni, “Apfi koghamba Daudi pfayawatumile iwanu watse kukukanza konoghelwa na aba wako? Daudi kawatuma iwasenga waghupelembe ghumji na waghusole.”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Apfo Hanuni kawaghogha iwasenga awala iwatumighwe na Daudi, kawagheta ndepfu tsawo ubali umwe, kaghadegha maghwanda ghawo mbaka mmadako, kuya kawaleka woke. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Iwanu hawamlongele Daudi imbuli ayo, Daudi kawatuma wanu waghende waketingane nawo kwaapfila tsawaghumighwa chinyala ng'ani. Naye mfalume Daudi kawalongela, “Mkale Yeriko mbaka tsindepfu tsenu hatsitsakota keli, baho muye ukaye.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Waamoni hawonile ka wamdesa Daudi, wawasola asikali Waaramu elufu ishilini iwoghenda kwa maghulu tangiya Beti Rehobu na Soba, pfipfila mfalume Maaka kasola asikali elufu imwe, na kulawa Tobu wasola asikali elufu kumi na weli. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Naye Daudi hayahulike tsimbuli atso, kamlaghitsa Yoabu yaghende na maasikali wose iwadahile ukwitowa pfinoghile. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Waamoni tsawalawa na kwitanda ukwitowa mna lilango lya ghumji ghwa Raba, ghumji ghwao mkulu, nawo Waaramu kulawa Soba na Rehobu na iwanu kulawa Tobu na Maaka wetanda kunyika.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu hayonile maasikali wema mna misululi yawo hambele na hachughu yake, kawasaghula maasikali wangi Waisiraeli iwadahile ukwitowa, kaweka wetowe na Waaramu.<verse eid="2SA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Maasikali awala wangi iwasighale kamsaghula ndugu yake Abishai yawalongotse, kaweka wetowe na Waamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu kamlongela Abishai, “Waaramu wang'awa na ngupfu kubita twetwe, utse unyapfile, lekeni Waamoni na ngupfu kubita ghweghwe, nitsakutsa kukwapfila. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Wighangamitse! Twitowe nawo kwa ngupfu ili tuwakombole iwanu wetu, na imiji ya Imulungu wetu, naye IMNDEWA katsotutendela aghala ighomnoghela.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Apfo Yoabu na iwanu wake waghendelela ukwitowa na Waaramu, nawo Waaramu watsuma. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Waamoni hawonile Waaramu watsuma, nawo pfipfila watsuma hambele ha Abishai waghenda kuna ghumji. Apfo Yoabu kaleka ukwitowa na Waamoni, koya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Waaramu hawonile watowighwa na Waisiraeli, wetingana hamwe. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeri kawalaghitsa Waaramu iwali kumwambu mwa ghumto Eufurate watse ako Helamu aku Shobaki mkulu wa maasikali wa Hadadezeri kowalongotsa. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi hayahulike tsimbuli atso, kawatinganitsa hamwe maasikali wose wa Waisiraeli, kaloka ghumto Yoridani kaghenda Helamu. Nawo Waaramu wetanda ghoya ili wetowe na Daudi, nawo wandusa ukwitowa naye.<verse eid="2SA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Lekeni Waaramu watsuma hambele ha Waisiraeli. Daudi kawakoma Waaramu miya saba iwang'ali wakwendesa mituka ya ng'ondo, na wadina falasi elufu alubaini. Pfipfila kamtowa Shobaki mkulu wa maasikali wawo, naye kafila kuko.<verse eid="2SA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Kuya wafalume wose iwali watumighwa wa Hadadezeri hawonile watowighwa na Waisiraeli, tsawelaghana na Waisiraeli waleke ukwitowa, nawo wawa watumighwa wa Waisiraeli. Apfo Waaramu wapfuka ukuwapfila keli Waamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Betisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Haghwanduse ghumwaka ghungi, msimu ghwa wafalume kughenda kung'ondo, Daudi tsakamtuma Yoabu yakawatowe Waamori, akuno kelongotsa na wakulu wa ing'ondo, na maasikali wose Waisiraeli. Nawo wawatowa na waghupfingila ghumji ghwa Raba. Lekeni Daudi mwenyegho yeye kakala Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Tsuwa limwe nemihe, Daudi kalamka mnanda kadina mchanya mwe ing'anda yake ya chifalume. Kulawa kuko kamwona pinga yumwe kakogha, na ipinga ayo tsakanogha sideke. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daudi kamtuma munu yaghutse ipinga ayo tsa nani. Imunu ayo kamlongela Daudi, “Ipinga ayo Batisheba neghe Eliabu, na mlume wake Uria, kulawa likabila lya Wahiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Daudi kawatuma wasenga wamghale. Kuya Batisheba katsa kwa Daudi naye Daudi kawasa naye, ipinga ayo tsakalawa sambi kumto, na tsakela, kuya koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Ipinga ayo tsakakinda inda, naye katuma munu yakamlongele Daudi ka kana inda yake.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Kuya, Daudi katuma nume kwa Yoabu kalonga, “Mtume Uria, wa likabila lya Hiti yatse kuna nene.” Naye Yoabu kamtuma Uria yaghende kwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uria hayapfikile, Daudi kamghutsa ka Yoabu kamgima, na iwanu wose ka wawagima, na ing'ondo pfaighendelela. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Kuya Daudi kamlongela Uria, “Uye ukaye yako ukabwihile chidogho.” Uria koka kulawa kuna ing'anda ya chifalume. Kuya mfalume Daudi kamtuma munu yamghalile nzawadi Uria. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Lekeni Uria ng'oyile ukaye yake baye, tsakawasa hamwe na watumighwa wose wa mfalume wake hane ghumlango ghwa ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daudi hayahulike ka Uria ng'okile baye ukaye yake, kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe kulawa kutali. Heule ng'aukile baye ukaye yako?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uria kamwidika Daudi “Sanduku lya laghano, hamwe na wamale we ng'ondo wa Isiraeli na Yuda wokala mna ipfibumbulika. Imkulu wangu Yoabu na watumighwa wa mfalume wokala kune mighunda. Apfi pfinogha nene ng'ende ukaye nikaje na ukunwa na kuwasa na ipinga wangu? Nene nelighita hambele hako sitenda baye chinu ka acho.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Kuya Daudi kamlongela Uria, “Ukale ahano mbaka ilupfi, kuya nitsokuleka uke.” Apfo litsuwa lilyo, Uria tsakakala Yerusalemu na ilupfi yake, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi kamkema Uria. Naye kaja na kunwa hamwe naye. Kuya Daudi kamnwesa Uria mbaka kapaitika. Hata apfo, chilo achila Uria ng'okile baye ukaye yake, ila kawasa mna chilagho chake hamwe na watumighwa wa mfalume wake. <verse eid="2SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Nemitondo, Daudi kandika baluwa, kamwing'a Uria yamghalile Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mna ibaluwa ayo Daudi tsakandika apfino; “Umwike Uria yeme hane msululo ghwa hambele, aho hane ng'ondo ng'ulu, kuya mumleke baho na muye kuchughu aho katsotowighwa na kakufa.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Apfo Yoabu hayang'ali koghupfingilila ghumji, kamwika Uria yeme hanu hayamanyile hana maasikali iwowehila iwadahile ukwitowa. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Iwanu wa ghumji agho walawa na kwitowa na Yoabu. Watumighwa wangi wa Daudi tsawakomighwa, Uria, Mhiti naye pfipfila kakomighwa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Baho Yoabu katuma munu yakamlongele Daudi chila chinu ichilawile kung'ondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />naye kamlaghitsa apfino, “Haumalitsa kumlongela mfalume chila chinu ichilawile kung'ondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />na mfalume yang'aghudubuka na kukughutsa, ‘Heule msoghelele habehi hamghendile kughutowa ghumji? Angu ngammanyile baye ka wang'awatowile na imishale kulawa mna imibanda ya ghumji ghwao? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Nani iyamkomile Abimeleki mwana wa Yerubesheti? Apfi si pinga yumwe baye iyasile libwe lya kuhondela kulawa mbanda, nalyo limkoma Abimeleki mna isi ya Tebesi? Heule msoghelele habehi na ubanda?’ Yang'akughutsa apfo, ghweghwe kutsomlongela apfi, ‘Hata mtumighwa wako Uria, Mhiti naye kafa.’”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Imsenga ayula kaghenda kwa Daudi kamlongela ghose ghayatumighwe na Yoabu yaghalonge. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Imsenga ayula kamlongela Daudi, “Maduwi tsetu tsawana ngupfu kubita twetwe, walawa mna tsikaye tsawo na watutsila kuna imighunda, lekeni twetwe tuwawinga mbaka kuna lilango lya ghumji. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Kuya watwasila imishale twetwe watumighwa wako kulawa mwibanda. Watumighwa wako wangi tsawakomighwa, hata mtumighwa wako Uria, Mhiti, naye pfipfila kafa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi kamlongela imunu ayula, “Ukamlongele apfino Yoabu, ‘Imbuli aino ileke kukutenyula ghumoyo, kwaapfila lipanga lyahela nenge, lyokoma wowose ayula. Mwongetse ngupfu mna kughutowa ghumji mbaka ghughwe’. Pfipfo pfautsomlongela Yoabu yaleke kutenyuka ghumoyo.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Batisheba mwehe wake Uria, hayahulike ka mmale wake kafa, kamlilila mmale wake. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ichililo hachimalile, Daudi kalaghitsa Batisheba yasolighwe yaghalighwe ukaye yake. Batisheba kawa pinga wa Daudi, naye kamwelekela Daudi mwana mmale. Lekeni ichinu acho chayatendile Daudi chimwihila IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nasani komlonga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Lelo, Imulungu kamtuma nabii Nasani kwa Daudi. Nasani kamghendela Daudi kamlongela, “Tsakuna wanu weli mna ghumji ghumwe, yumwe tsakana mali nyingi na yungi tsa muhingwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Ayula iyana tsimali tsakana ng'olo wengi na ng'ombe wengi. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Lekeni umuhingwa ayula tsakana ng'olo pinga yumwe mdodo iyamghulile. Tsakamlela, naye kakulila ukaye yake hamwe na iwanaghe. Ichijo chayakuja yeye naye ing'olo wake kakuja chicho, na ichikombe chayang'ali yakunwela chicho chayanwele ing'olo ayo, pfipfila yang'ali yomuhaghatilagha mmambagha. Ing'olo ayo tsakawa ka neghe wake imuhingwa ayo. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Tsuwa limwe kapfika mgheni yumwe ukaye kwa imunu ayula yana tsimali. Lelo ayula yana tsimali ng'abamile baye kusola ing'olo wake yumwe au ng'ombe wake yamchinjile mgheni wake, ila kaghenda kumboka imuhingwa ayula ing'olo wake, yakamchinjile imgheni wake.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi hayahulike agho, kamghudubukila imunu ayula yana tsimali, kamlongela nabii Nasani, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, imunu iyatendile chinu achino kobamighwa yafe ghendo! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Kobamighwa yamlihe imuhingwa ayula ng'olo wane kwa ayula yumwe iyambokile, kwaapfila chayatendile chiha na kahela libatsi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Nasani kamlongela Daudi, “Ghweghwe yuyo imunu ayo! Lelo apfi pfipfo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli pfayolonga, ‘Nene nikubaka mapfuta uwe mfalume wa Isiraeli na nikukombola mna ghamoko gha Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Tsanikwing'a ing'anda yake, na wehe wake wawe wako, kuya tsanikwing'a iwanu wa Isiraeli na Yuda uwatawale. Ka aghano ghanikwing'ile tsa chidogho kuna ghweghwe, ning'akongetse keli kubita agho. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ule lelo, kubetsa laghitso lyangu nene IMNDEWA, na kutenda alino lihile hambele hangu? Kumkoma Uria, Mhiti kung'ondo, kumsola pinga wake yawe pinga wako. Kuwatumila Waamoni kumkoma Uria kung'ondo! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Lelo iwanu wa ikaye yako nawo ng'awatsoleka ukukomighwa baye, kwaapfila ghweghwe kunibetsa na kumsola pinga wa Uria, Mhiti yawe pinga wako.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Lelo tegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA, ‘Lola, nitsokughalila maghayo kuna ing'anda yako mwenyegho. Nitsowasola wapinga tsako aku mwenyegho kolola kwa nenge tsako na nitsomwing'a mmale yungi, naye katsowasa nawo hatselu. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Ghweghwe tsakutenda chinu achino kwa kwipfisa, lekeni nene nitsotenda aghano nemisi ghendo aku Waisiraeli wose wolola.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Lelo Daudi kamlongela Nasani, “Nimtendela nzambi IMNDEWA.” Nasani kamlongela, “IMNDEWA kakuleghusila nzambi tsako, naghwe ng'utsakufa baye. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Lekeni kwaapfila kumbetsa ghendo IMNDEWA, imwanagho yautsomweleka katsakufa.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Kuya Nasani koya ukaye yake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Imwana wa Daudi kakufa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">IMNDEWA kamtenda imwana wa Betisheba, ipinga wa Uria iyeleke Daudi yaghule. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi kamlomba Imulungu imwana yahone. Tsakafunga ukuja, kengila kuna ichiheleto chake, kawasa hasi chilo chose. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Iwanzehe wa ing'anda yake wema habehi naye, wabama yenuke, lekeni yeye kalema na ng'ajile baye chijo chochose hamwe nawo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Mna litsuwa lya saba hambele, imwana ayo kafa. Watumighwa wa Daudi tsawapfuka kumlongela ka imwana kafa, kwaapfila tsawaghamba, “Imwana hayang'ali kamgima tsatulonga naye lekeni ng'atutegheletse baye. Lelo tutsomlongelatse ka imwanaghe kafa? Ng'ambe katselagha.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi hayawonile watumighwa wake wenong'onetsa tsakamanya ka imwanaghe kafa. Apfo kawaghutsa, “Apfi imwana kafa?” Nawo wamwidika, “Ona kafa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Kuya Daudi kenuka ahala hasi, kogha, kebaka ghamafuta na kapfala maghwanda ghake ghangi. Kuya tsakaghenda kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu na kutambika. Pfipfila tsakoya ukaye na kalomba ichijo, keng'ighwa, naye tsakaja. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Iwatumighwa wake wamghutsa, “Angu achi chinu chachi chautendile? Imwana hayawile ka mgima ghweghwe kufunga ukuja na kumlilila. Lekeni hayafile, ghweghwe kwinuka na kuja ichijo.”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi kawedika, “Ona imwana hayakalile mgima tsanifunga na kulila. Tsanitenda apfo kwaapfila tsanonga nani iyomanya? Songaa IMNDEWA katsombonela libatsi ili imwana yawe mgima. <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Lekeni sambi kafa, heule nene nifunge? Apfi nene nodaha kumuyitsa muisi? Tsuwa limwe nitsoghenda ako kwayaghendile, lekeni yeye ng'odaha baye ukuya kuna nene.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Kuya Daudi kamkanza ipinga wake Batisheba. Kawasa naye, naye kakinda inda na keleka mwana mmale, Daudi kamkema taghwa lyake Selemani. IMNDEWA tsakamkunda imwana ayo. <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Naye IMNDEWA tsakamtuma nabii Nasani yaghende yakamlongele Daudi yamkeme imwana ayo Yedidia, mana yake, iyakundighwe na IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi koghuboka ghumji ghwa Raba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Mmats 20:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ichipindi acho Yoabu ketowa na iwanu wa Raba, ghumji ghwa Waamoni, naye kaghuboka ghumji agho ghwa chifalume. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu katuma nume kwa Daudi kalonga, “Nighuboka ghumji ghwa Raba, na niliboka litsimbu lyawo lya ghamatsi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Lelo wakeme maasikali wose iwasighale, ukale baho ughutsunguluke na ughuboke. Hela ning'aghuboka nene ghutsokemighwa kwa taghwa lyangu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Apfo, Daudi kawakema asikali wose kaghenda Raba, kaghutowa na kaghuboka ghumji agho. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Kuya kasola litaji lya mfalume wawo kulawa mna litwi lyake. Utsito wa litaji alyo lya nzahabu kilo selasini na tano, mghati mwake tsa mna libwe lya bei ng'ulu. Naye Daudi kasola libwe alyo kalika mna litaji lyake na kalipfala mna litwi lyake. Pfipfila tsakaboka pfinu pfingi ng'ani mna ghumji agho. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Kuya kawasola iwanu wa isi ayo kaweka wasang'ane kwa kutumila misumeno, sululu tsa chuma, hoya tsa chuma na kuwatumila wasang'ane mna tanuri lya ghamatofali, apfo pfipfo pfaitendile isi yose ya Waamoni. Kuya Daudi na maasikali wose woya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnoni na Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Absalomu tsakana lumbu wake iyanoghile sideke iyakemighwe Tamari. Amnoni mwana yungi wa Daudi, tsakamkunda sideke Tamari. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnoni tsakaghanzika sideke kwa kumkunda Tamari, mbaka ketenda yoneke koghula, kwaapfila ghendo Tamari tsang'ana yawase na mmale baye, na ng'aidahike baye kwa Amnoni kutenda naye chinu chochose. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Lekeni Amnoni tsakana sale yake iyakemighwe Yonadabu, mwana wa Shama, ndughu yake Daudi. Yonadabu yeye tsakakengela sideke. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu kamghutsa Amnoni, “Ghweghwe kwa mwana wa mfalume, heule usoka chila hakukucha? Heule ng'aubama baye kunongela?” Amnoni kamlongela apfino, “Nomkunda sideke Tamari, lumbu wa ndughu yangu Absalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu kamlongela, “Uwase mwisatsi mwako, utende ka koghula, na aba wako hayatsakutsa kukulola, mlongele, ‘Nokulomba, umleke Tamari, yatse yangaye chighate ndiye, na yanyikile chijo hambele hangu ili nichone naye mwenyegho yanyang'itse kwa ghumoko ghwake.’”<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Apfo Amnoni kaghendelela kawasa mlili. Mfalume hayaghendile kumlola, Amnoni kamlongela, “Nokulomba umleke Tamari yatse ahano yanyambikile pfighate hambele hangu, kuya yeye mwenyegho yanyang'itse.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Apfo Daudi katuma wanu wakamlongele Tamari yaghende ukaye kwa Amnoni yakamwambikile ichijo. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Naye Tamari kaghenda ako, kampfika Amnoni kawasa. Kasola utimbo kaupfulugha koka pfighate aku Amnoni kolola. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Tamari kahula ichiya china ipfighate kamghalila Amnoni, lekeni Amnoni tsakalema kuja, kalonga, “Chila munu yalawe kunze,” na wose tsawoka. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Kuya Amnoni kamlongela Tamari, “Lelo ngalile ipfighate apfo kuna ichiheleto changu, kuya unyang'itse.” Tamari kasola ipfighate pfayambike kapfighala kuna ichiheleto cha Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Hayang'ali yomwang'itsa ipfighate apfo, Amnoni kamghogha Tamari, kamlongela, “Utse uwase na nene.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamari kamlongela, “Baye lumbu wangu, uleke kuninanahitsa. Chinu achino ng'achibamighwa baye chitendeke mna Isiraeli. Uleke kutenda chinu achino cha ubotsi. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Lelo nene, chihanga changu nitsochika kwani kwa chinyala acho? Naghwe ng'ambe kutsakuwa yumwe wa wabotsi mna isi ya Isiraeli. Lelo nokulomba ulonge na mfalume, yeye ng'atsokughoma baye kunikwela.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Lekeni Amnoni ng'abamile baye kumtegheletsa kwaapfila tsakana ngupfu kubita yeye, kamnanahitsa kawasa naye.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Kuya Amnoni kamwihila ng'ani Tamari. Tsakamwihila Tamari kubita pfayang'ali yomkunda aho mwanduso. Kamlongela Tamari, “Lawa uke.”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamari kamwidika, “Si pfipfo baye lumbu wangu, ukuniwinga nene kwakuwa kwiha kubita apfila pfaunitendele.” Lekeni Amnoni ng'abamile baye kumtegheletsa. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Kamkema msongolo wake iyang'ali iyomtumikila, kamlongela, “Mlapfe ipinga ayuno hambele hangu. Na uhinde ghumlango.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Imsongolo ayula kamlapfa kunze, kahinda ghumlango. Tamari tsakapfala joho tali likighwe unzolingo lina ghamoko matali kwaapfila apfo pfipfo pfawapfalile neghe tsake mfalume iwali ng'ana wawase na mmale baye mna matsuwa agho. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Baho, Tamari kebaka lipfu mwitwi, kadegha lijoho lyake, keka ghamoko ghake mwitwi, kuya koka aku kangula chililo.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Lumbu wake Absalomu hayamwonile kamghutsa, “Angu Amnoni kawasa na ghweghwe? Nyamale lumbu wangu. Yeye ka ndughu yako. Imbuli aino ileke kukutama ng'ani mmoyo.” Apfo Tamari tsakakala ukaye kwa Absalomu, aku kana usungu mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Mfalume Daudi hayahulike aghala ighatendeke tsakona maya ng'ani. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Absalomu tsakamwihila sideke Amnoni, ng'alongile naye baye kwa chochose chila chiwe chiha au chinogha, kwaapfila tsakamghogha kwa ngupfu lumbu wake na kuwasa naye.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalomu komkoma Amnoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Miyaka mili hambele, Absalomu na watumighwa wake wang'ali wowaghana imighala wang'olo wake ako Baali Hasori habehi na ghumji ghwa Efraimu. Kawakema iwana wamale wose wa mfalume waghende kuna ichihungo.<verse eid="2SA 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Absalomu kamghendela mfalume Daudi, kamlongela, “Lola nene mtumighwa wako ninawo iwanu iwowaghana wang'olo imighala. Nokulomba ghweghwe mfalume hamwe na watumighwa wako, tukeni hamwe na nene mtumighwa wako.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mfalume kamwidika, “Baye mwanangu, tuleke kughenda wose, hela tutsakuwa mtsigho kuna ghweghwe.” Hata ka Absalomu yang'ali yomdedetsa aba wake yaghende, lekeni mfalume kalema ukughenda, ila kambaliki.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Kuya Absalomu kamlongela, “Ka ng'aughenda baye, lelo mleke ndughu yangu Amnoni tughende naye.” Mfalume kamwidika,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">“Lekeni hebali yaghende hamwe na mwemwe?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Lekeni Absalomu kaghendelela kumdedetsa, mbaka mfalume kamlekelela Amnoni na wanaghe wangi waghende kuna ichihungo acho. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Absalomu kawalongela watumighwa wake, “Mloleseni Amnoni, hayatsakunwa na ukupatika, na nene hanitsowalongela, ‘Mtoweni Amnoni,’ mwemwe mkomeni ghendo. Alyo laghitso lyangu. Muwe na ngupfu na mleke ukupfuka.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Apfo, watumighwa wa Absalomu wamtendela Amnoni ka pfawalaghitsighwe na Absalomu. Kuya iwana wangi wamale wa mfalume woka, na chila yumwe kadina punda falasi wake katsuma.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Hawang'ali wamnzila, Daudi tsakahulika ka Absalomu kawakoma wanaghe wose, na kuduhu hata yumwe iyalekighwe mgima. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Mfalume Daudi kenuka, kadegha maghwanda ghake kwa usungu, kawasa hasi. Hata watumighwa wake iwemile habehi naye wadegha maghwanda ghawo. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Lekeni baho katsa Yonadabu mwana wa Shimea ndughu wa Daudi kamlongela, “Mkulu wangu, uleke kughamba ka wanagho wose wakomighwa. Amnoni yaliyeka yuyo iyakomighwe. Absalomu tsakabama kughatenda aghano kulawa matsuwa aghala Amnoni hayamghoghile Tamali ndughu yake na kuwasa naye kwa ngupfu. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Apfo, mkulu wangu mfalume uleke kughamba mna ghumoyo ghwako ka iwanagho wose wafa. Amnoni yaliyeka yuyo yakomighwe.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Lekeni Absalomu tsakatsuma koka. Baho imbetetsi wa ing'anda ya mfalume kona wanu wengi wakutsa kulawa mchidunda mna inzila ilawa Horonaimu. Apfo Kaghenda kumlongela mfalume aghala ghayonile. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu kamlongela Daudi, “Lola mfalume, iwanagho wakutsa ka pfanikulongele nene mtumighwa wako.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Imtumighwa ayula hayamalitse ukulonga, iwana wamale wa mfalume wengila, wangula chililo. Mfalume na iwatumighwa wake wose nawo walila kwa usungu. <verse eid="2SA 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Lekeni Absolamu tsakatsumila kwa mfalume wa ghumji ghwa Geshuri iyakemighwe Talimai, mwana wa Amihudi. Mfalume Daudi kamlilila mwanaghe Amnoni kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Apfo Absalomu hayatsumile kuna ghumji ghwa Geshuri, kakala ako kwa miyaka midatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Lekeni hambele, usungu wa ukufa imwanaghe Amnoni haumalile, mfalume Daudi kabama sideke kumwona imwanaghe Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Absalomu kakuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana wa Seruya, tsakamanya ghendo ka mfalume Daudi kobama sideke kumwona imwanaghe Absalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Apfo kawatuma wanu waghende Tekoa wakambamile ipinga iyakengele. Hawamghalile, kamlongela, “Witende ka kuna chililo. Upfale maghwanda gha ukudomboketsa, uleke kwibaka mapfuta, witende ka ipinga iyodomboketsa kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Kuya ughende kwa mfalume ukamlongele aghano ghanikulongela.” Apfo Yoabu kamlongela cha ukulonga.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Ipinga ayo kalawa Tekoa kaghenda kwa mfalume, kamwinamila mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi, kamlongela, “Ghwe mfalume unyapfile.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Ubama choni?” Ipinga ayula kamwidika, “Nene nachitsuka, immale wangu kafa. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Tsanina wana wamale weli. Tsuwa limwe hawang'ali wa kwibagho tsawesonga. Kwaapfila tsakuduhu munu wowose wa kuwalamla, mwanangu yumwe kamkoma miyaghe. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Lelo ndughu tsangu wose wanihundukila nene mtumighwa wako, wabama niweng'e imwanangu iyamkomile miyaghe nawo wamkome, kwaapfila pfayamkomile ndughu yake. Wang'atenda apfo, nitsokala nahela ghendo mwana wa kuhala isi yangu. Apfo watsotsima ghendo itala yangu ikalile, pfipfila litaghwa na lukolo lwa mmale wangu litsohupa ghendo mna isi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Mfalume kamlongela ipinga ayula, “Uye ukaye yako, nitsolaghitsa choni chitendeke.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Ipinga ayula kulawa Tekoa kalonga, “Mkulu wangu mfalume, ka chanikulomba chakoneka totso, totso alyo liwe lyangu nene na lya iwanu wa ing'anda ya aba wangu, lekeni lileke kuwa lya mfalume na ufalume wako.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Imunu wowose iyatsokutsupfa mghale kuna nene, naye ng'atsokuyila keli baye.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ipinga ayula kamlongela, “Nokulomba mfalume, umkumbuke IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, uwaghome ndughu tsangu iwobama kumkoma imwanangu kwa kumkoma miyaghe, waleke kumwagha keli idamu.” Mfalume Daudi kamwidika, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, kuduhu hata lupfili lumwe lwa imwanagho ilutsolaghala hasi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Ipinga ayula kamlongela, “Nokulomba, nene mtumighwa wako, nonge chinu chimwe kuna ghweghwe,” Mfalume kamlongela, “Longa.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Ipinga ayula kamlongela, “Hebali utendile chinu achino chihile kwa iwanu wa Imulungu? Ng'aumlekelele baye imwanagho yoye kulawa kwayatsumile, lelo kwehigha ghumwenyegho kwa achila chaulongile. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Twetwe ka ghamatsi ighakwitika hasi, kuduhu yodaha kughatsola, wose twakufa. Hata Imulungu ng'owoyitsa baye iwanu wafile wawe wagima, ila mfalume kodaha ukubama inzila ya ukumuyitsa ayula iyatsumile kutali, yoye. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Nene nitsa kulonga na ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, kwaapfila iwanu wanenda nipfuke, tsanonga, ‘Lelo nene mtumighwa wako tsanonga, leka ng'ende nikalonge na mfalume songaa katsongaya chanibama nene mtumighwa wake. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Yeye katsonitegheletsa na kunikombola kulawa kwa imunu iyobama kunikoma nene na imwanangu kulawa kuna isi iyatwing'ile Imulungu.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Lelo nene mtumighwa wako nolonga, ‘Imbuli ya mkulu wangu mfalume itsongaya ingupfu mmoyo mwangu kwaapfila ghweghwe mfalume kweghala na imalaika wa Imulungu mna ukumanya ighanoghile na ighehile. Naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako yawe hamwe naghwe.’” <verse eid="2SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Kuya mfalume kamwidika ipinga ayula, “Uleke kunipfisa chinu chochose chanikughutsa.” Ipinga ayula kalonga. “Longa mkulu wangu mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Apfi si Yoabu baye iyakulongele utende apfino?” Ipinga ayula kalonga, “Nelaha kuna ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume iyuli mgima, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kubela kukulongela achila ichilongesa kwa acho chaulonga mkulu wangu mfalume. Yeye Yoabu ghendo mtumighwa wako iyanongele nonge apfino. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu tsakatenda apfo ili walangule chinu chingi keli. Lekeni ghweghwe mkulu wangu, kukengela na komanya chila chinu ichitendeka muisi ka imalaika wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Kuya mfalume kamkema Yoabu, kamlongela, “Pinogha, lelo nitoghola kutenda chaubama. Ughende ukamuyitse imsongolo Absalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu kenama mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi, kambaliki mfalume, kalonga, “Leloli kunendela uluso nene mtumighwa wako, ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, kwaapfila kunitogholela achila chanikulombile.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Apfo Yoabu koka Geshuri, kamuyitsa Absalomu mna isi ya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Lekeni mfalume kalonga, “Absalomu yoke yakakale kutali, kuna ing'anda yake, yaleke kwona ichihanga changu.” Apfo Absalomu kaghenda ukaye yake, naye ng'achonile baye ichihanga cha mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalomu na mfalume Daudi wepatana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mna Isiraeli yose tsakuduhu munu wowose yatunyighwe kwa ukunogha ka Absalomu. Kwanzila kwitsayo kwake mbaka kuchihanga tsakahela ng'opfu yoyose baye. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Yang'ali yobeyagha tsimvili tsake chila ghumwaka hatsiwile ng'ulu na nito, na hayatsilingile tsing'ali tsipfikagha kilo mbili kwa kulingila ipfinu pfawalingile wafalume. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Absalomu tsakana wana wamale wadatu, na mwana pinga yumwe iyakemighwe Tamari, naye Tamari tsakanogha sideke.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Lelo, Absalomu tsakakala mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu kwa miyaka mili, na ng'onile baye chihanga cha mfalume Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Kuya, Absalomu kamkema Yoabu yamtume yaghale usenga kwa mfalume, lekeni Yoabu kalema. Kamkema lwakeli lekeni Yoabu kalema keli ukutsa. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Baho Absalomu kawalongela iwatumighwa wake, “Lola, Yoabu kana mghunda ghwa ishayili habehi na mghunda ghwangu. Ghendani mkaghulakatse.” Apfo iwatumighwa wa Absalomu waghenda kughulakatsa mghunda ghwa Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu kaghenda ukaye kwa Absalomu kamghutsa, “Hebali watumighwa wako waghulakatsa ghumghunda ghwangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Absalomu kamwidika, “Lola, tsanikukema utse akuno nikutume kwa mfalume, ukamghutse, ‘Heule mbuyile kulawa Geshuri? Tsapfinogha nene nikale kuko.’ Lelo unyapfile mbone ichihanga cha mfalume. Ka nenda totso yanikome!”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Apfo Yoabu kaghenda kwa mfalume, kamlongela agho ghose. Kuya mfalume kamkema Absalomu, naye kaghenda kwa mfalume, kenama mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi. Na mfalume kamnonela Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Absalomu kobama ukuboka ufalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Haghamalile agho, Absalomu kesolela mtuka ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi, falasi na wanu hamsini iwotsuma hambele hake. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Absalomu yang'ali yolamkagha nemitondotondo na kwimagha mmbalimbali mwa inzila ighenda kuna lilango lya ghumji. Munu wowose iyoghala lighomba lyake kwa mfalume yakalilamle yang'abita aho, Absalomu komkema imunu ayo kumbalimbali komghutsa, “Ghweghwe ulawa mji ghwachi?” Imunu ayo yang'alonga, “Nolawa mna kabila limwe lya Isiraeli,” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Absalomu kamlongela, “Ghomba lyako lyaulonga lyolongesa ghendo. Lekeni kuduhu imunu wowose iyasaghulighwe na mfalume yakutegheletse.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Pfipfila Absalomu kamlongela, “Ka nene ning'awile mlamlitsi wa Isiraeli, chila munu yana lighomba yang'anitsila, nene ning'ahighile ghomba lyake pfinoghile!”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Pfipfila Absalomu yang'ali yogholosagha ghumoko ghwake yamhaghatile na komnonela chila munu iyatsile kumlamsa kwa kumwinamila. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Apfi pfipfo Absalomu pfayawatendele Waisiraeli wose iwatsile kwa mfalume yawalamle. Apfo, Absalomu kaitenda imimoyo ya Waisiraeli imtoghole yeye.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Miyaka mine haipfosile Absalomu kamlongela mfalume, “Nokulomba unileke ng'ende ako Hebroni nikatimitse natsili yanyikile kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Hanikalile Geshuri ako Aramu tsanimwikila laghano IMNDEWA, nonga, ‘Ka IMNDEWA katsombuyitsa Yerusalemu, nitsomwabudu yeye ako Hebroni.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Ughende tseghamba.” Absalomu kaghenda Hebroni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Lekeni Absalomu kawatuma wasenga chinyelenyele kuna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli, walonge, “Hamtsohulika imalati yotowighwa, longeni, ‘Absalomu ka mfalume ako Hebroni!’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Absalomu tsakelongotsa na wanu miya mbili iyawakemile kulawa Yerusalemu, awo tsawaghenda ako aku ng'awamanyile baye chinu chochose chayabamile ukutenda Absalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Absalomu hayang'ali yolapfa nambiko, tsakatuma munu yaghende yakamkeme Ahitafeli, imshauli wa mfalume Daudi kulawa kuna ghumji ghwake ghwa Gilo. Litsengwe liwa kulu na iwanu iwomtegheletsa Absalomu nawo wongetseka.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Daudi kotsuma Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Msenga yumwe kamghendela Daudi kamlongela, “Imimoyo ya iwanu wa Isiraeli sambi imhundukila Absalomu!”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Kuya Daudi kawalongela watumighwa wake iwakalile naye Yerusalemu, “Mwinuke tutsume, ka ng'atutsuma baye kuduhu munu wowose mna twetwe iyodaha kumhepa Absalomu. Tusumke tuke, hela katsotughalila lifwa na kuwakoma kwa lipanga iwanu wose iwali mna ghumji.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Lekeni watumighwa wake wamlongela, “Twetwe watumighwa wako, mkulu wetu mfalume, totoghola kutenda chochose chaulamla.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Apfo mfalume koka hamwe na iwanu iwali hakaye hake, lekeni kawaleka mapinga wake wadodo kumi wailolese ing'anda ya mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Mfalume koka, na iwanu wose wamuwinza, lekeni hawapfikile kutali chidogho, hana ing'anda ya utsighilo, wabwihila. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Watumighwa wake wose wamlongolela, aku welongotsa na Wakereti wose, na Wapeleti wose, na Wagiti miya sita kulawa mna ghumji ghwa Gati iwelongotse na mfalume Daudi tsawapfosa hambele hake. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Kuya mfalume Daudi kamlongela Itai, Mgiti, “Hebali naghwe wilongotsa na twetwe? Uye ukakale na mfalume Absalomu, kwaapfila ghweghwe akuno kwa mgheni, pfipfila ghweghwe kwa munu yutsumile ukaye yako. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Ghweghwe kutsa akuno jutsi baha, hebali nikutende wangewange na twetwe aku nene nimwenyegho sikumanyile baye hata kwanighenda? Uye ukaye hamwe na ndughu tsako. Yeye IMNDEWA katsokutendela wende wake na uluso wake.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Lekeni Itai kamwidika mfalume, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, na ka ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume pfaukala mgima, kokose mkulu wangu mfalume kwaughenda, nene mtumighwa wako nitsoghenda naghwe, kuwe kuna ugima au kuna ukufa.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Daudi kamlongela Itai, “Pfinogha! Ghenda lelo, ghendelela hambele.” Apfo Itai kabita yeye imwenyegho, na iwanu wake wose, na hamwe na iwana wawo. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi hayang'ali yobita hamwe na iwanu wake, iwanu wose iwali muisi wangula chililo. Mfalume Daudi kaloka ichikolongo cha Kidroni hamwe na iwanu wose, waloka waghenda kunyika.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Mtambika Abiatari na mtambika Sadoki tsawaghenda nawo. Pfipfila Walawi wose tsawaghenda aku woduta lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu. Walihulumsa hasi lisanduku alila lya Imulungu, na mtambika Abiatari kalapfa nambiko mbaka iwanu wose hawapfosile kulawa kuna ghumji. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela Sadoki, “Lyuitse lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Ka IMNDEWA konitogholela, katsombuyitsa nilyone keli lisanduku lyake na kwona hanu halikala. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Lekeni ka IMNDEWA ng'onitogholela baye, yanitendele chochose chayakona yeye chinogha.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Mfalume Daudi kamlongela keli Sadoki, imtambika, “Msole mwanagho Ahimaasi na Yonasani mwana wa Abiatari muye ukaye tseghamba. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Lekeni nitsobeta hanu haitingana imito ako kunyika, mbaka hanitsohulika mbuli kulawa kuna ghweghwe.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Apfo Sadoki na Abiatari walyuitsa lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, nawo wakala kuko.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Lekeni Daudi, kagheluka ilughongo lwa mitseituni aku kolila, ng'apfalile mikwabatsa baye na litwi lyake kalighubika. Na iwanu iwelongotse naye tsawaghubika ghamatwi ghawo na wang'ali wodina ilughongo aku wolila. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Kuya Daudi kahulika ka Ahitofeli na iwanu wa Absalomu sambi lyawo limwe. Lekeni Daudi kalomba, kalonga, “Nokulomba ghwe IMNDEWA, chochose Ahitofeli chayomlongela Absalomu yatende, ghweghwe uchitende choneke cha ubotsi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi hayapfikile kuchidanando kwa ichidunda, hanu ha ukumtambikila Imulungu, munu yumwe taghwa lyake Hushai kulawa Ariki katsa kumbokela, lijoho lyake kalideghadegha na kebakatsa timbwisi mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi kamlongela, “Ung'aghenda hamwe na nene, ghweghwe kwakuwa ka mtsigho kuna nene. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Lekeni ka kutsakuya Yerusalemu na kumlongela Absalomu, ‘Nitsakuwa mtumighwa wako, ghwe mfalume, ka apfila pfaniwile mtumighwa wa aba wako aho ghumwande.’ Kwa ukutenda apfo kutsomtopfaghitsa Ahitofeli yaleke ukutenda chayobama. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Mtambika Sadoki na mtambika Abiatari wawo wakuko. Apfo chochose chautsohulika kulawa ukaye kwa mfalume, ghweghwe walongele wawo. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Lola, iwana wawo weli wamale, Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki, na Yonasani mwana wa Abiatari, nawo pfipfila wa hamwe nawo. Namwe chochose chamtsohulika mtsonongela kubitila wawo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Apfo Hushai, sale yake mfalume Daudi, koya kuna ghumji, aku naye Absalomu kakwingila mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi hayatsingile chidogho kunzingo kwa ichidando, baho ketingana na Siba, mtumighwa wa Mefibosheti kombeta, tsakana pfihongwe weli iwadutile pfighate miya mbili, pfikungwi miya pfa nzabibu tsinyalile, na matunda miya imwe gha msimu ghwa chiyangatsi, na mkoba ghwa ngotsi ighumemile dipfai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Mfalume kamghutsa Siba, “Hebali ughalile pfinu apfino?” Siba kamwidika, “Wapfihongwe watsowadina iwanu wa ikaye yako, ipfighate na tsinzabibu watsakuja wasongolo wose, idipfai watsakunwa iwanu iwatsotsilika kunyika.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Mefibosheti, imwana wa mkulu wako, yalikwani?” Siba kamlongela mfalume, “Yeye kakala Yerusalemu kwaapfila kalonga, ‘Leloli iwanu wa Isiraeli wombuyitsila ufalume wa sekulu wangu Sauli.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Baho mfalume kamlongela Siba, “Lelo chila chinu cha Mefibosheti cha kwako.” Siba kamlongela, “Mighede mkulu wangu mfalume, Nene nolomba unitendele wende wako wa ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei komlighita mfalume Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Daudi hayapfikile Bahurimu, tsakalawila munu yumwe wa lukolo lwa Sauli, taghwa lyake Shimei mwana wa Gera, kandusa kumlighita Daudi aku koghenda mmbalimbali mwa inzila. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Yang'ali yomwasila ghamabwe mfalume Daudi hamwe na watumighwa wake. Iwatumighwa wake wose, na iwakalitsi wake tsawamtsunguluka Daudi kujilo na kumoso. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei kamlighitia Daudi, kalonga, “Ghenda ako, ghenda ako, ghweghwe mkoma wanu, ghweghwe ng'uli minu ghendo baye! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />IMNDEWA kakuyitsila ghautendile kwa kuwakoma iwanu wose wa ikaye ya Sauli, na sambi MNNDEWA kamsaghula imwanagho Absalomu yawe mfalume. Lelo, koghaya kwaapfila ghweghwe kukoma wanu wengi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Kuya Abishai mwana wa Seruya, kamlongela mfalume, “Hebali yumbwa ayuno yafile yokulighita ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume? Undeke ng'ende nikaghane litwi lyake.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Lekeni mfalume kalonga, “Angu nene nina choni na mwemwe iwana wa Seruya? Ka IMNDEWA kamlongela, ‘Mlighite Daudi,’ Nani yodaha kughutsa, ‘Hebali utenda apfo?’”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Lekeni mfalume Daudi kamlongela Abishai na watumighwa wake wose, “Ka imwanangu mwenyegho kobama yanikome. Lelo imunu ayuno wa likabila lya Benyamini yatsolekatse ukutenda apfino? Mwemwe mlekeni yanilighite kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamlaghitsa yanilighite. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Songaa IMNDEWA katsolola apfino pfanighaya, na katsoniliha ighanoghile kwa ukulighitighwa akuno kwanilighitighwa leloli.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Apfo mfalume Daudi na iwanu wake waghendelela na ghumwanza ghwao aku Shimei yang'ali yoghenda mmbalimbali mwa ichidunda komkoleletsa Daudi mwambu na mwambu. Shimei yang'ali yomlighita Daudi na kumwasila ghamabwe, na kumdimlila litimbwisi aku koghenda. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Kuya mfalume na iwanu iwakalile hamwe naye, wapfika kuna ghumto Yoridani aku wepfa ghendo, na baho wabwihila.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalomu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Apfo Absalomu na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, wapfika kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu hamwe na Ahitofeli. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushai kulawa Ariki, sale yake Daudi, kamghendela Absalomu, kamlongela, “Imulungu yakwike mgima mfalume! Imulungu yakwike mgima mfalume!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Absalomu kamlongela Hushai, “Angu apfi pfipfo pfaumkunda sale yako Daudi? Hebali ng'ughendile baye na isale yako?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai kamwidika, “Baye! Ayula iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA, na iwanu awano wose, na Waisiraeli wose, ayo yuyo nene nitsakuwa wake, na yuyo yanitsokala naye. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Kubita agho, nene nimtumikile nani? Angu si imwana wa sale yangu baye? Nitsomtumikila yeye ka pfanimtumikile aba wako.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Kuya Absalomu kamlongela Ahitofeli, “Nilongele, lelo tutende choni?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli kamlongela Absalomu, “Uwase na mapinga wadodo wa aba wako wayawalekile walolese ing'anda ya mfalume. Na iwanu wa Isiraeli watsohulika ka ghweghwe komtenda aba wako yakuhile, apfo iwanu wose iwokuwinza ghweghwe watsoghumighwa ngupfu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Apfo, iwanu wamtindimikila Absalomu hema mchanya mwa ing'anda ya mfalume, naye Absalomu kawengilila mapinga wadodo wa aba wake aku Waisiraeli wose wolola.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Matsuwa agho, ushauli wowose wayalongile Ahitofeli tsa woneka ka ulapfighwa na Imulungu! Na chochose chayalongile tsachiwinzighwa na Daudi na Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai komlongotsa pfihile Absalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitofeli kamlongela Absalomu, “Nileke nisaghule wanu elufu kumi na weli, nighende nikamwinzilitse Daudi chilo achino. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nitsomtowa yang'awa kepfa na kahela ngupfu, na nene nitsomtenda yapfuke. Iwanu wose iwakalile hamwe naye watsotsuma. Nitsomkoma mfalume yaliyeka, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kuwoyitsa iwanu wose kuna ghweghwe ka apfila ipinga iyakwelighwe pfayoghenda ukaye kwa mlume wake. Ukukomighwa kwa munu yumwe yumbama kutsowatenda iwanu wose wakale tseghamba.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Acho chayalongile Ahitofeli tsa chimnoghela Absalomu na iwanzehe wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Kuya, Absalomu kalonga, “Pfipfila mkemeni Hushai, iyolawa Ariki, tuhulike naye chayolonga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai hayapfikile kwa Absalomu, Absalomu kamghutsa, “Apfino pfipfo pfayalongile Ahitofeli, lelo tutende ka pfayatulongele? Ka si pfipfo baye, naghwe tulongele, tutendetse?” <verse eid="2SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai kamlongela Absalomu, “Chayalongile Ahitofeli kwa sambi ng'achinoghile baye. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Ghweghwe komanya ghendo apfila aba wako na iwanu wake pfawadahile ukwitowa, na sambi wakali ka simba iyabokighwe iwanaghe kubagho. Pfipfila aba wako yeye ka munu wa ng'ondo. Yeye ng'atsokala baye na iwanu wake chilo chigima bila kughenda kwitowa. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata sambi yeye kepfisa kuna lipondo au hanu hangi. Ka iwanu wa Daudi watsakwanza ukuwatowa, munu wowose iyatsohulika katsolonga, ‘Iwanu wa Absalomu wawo iwakomighwe.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Kuya hata iwanu wako iwali na mimoyo ka ya simba, watsotenyuka mimoyo, kwaapfila Waisiraeli wose womanya ghendo ka aba wako, na wose iwali hamwe naye wadaha ukwitowa. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Chanikulongela nene achino ahano, uwakeme Waisiraeli wose wetingane kuna ghweghwe, kulawa Dani ili kasikazini mbaka Beeri Sheba, ili kusini, wawe wengi ka msanga ghwa kumwani, na ghweghwe ghumwenyegho ughende kuna ing'ondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Na twetwe tutsompfamila Daudi kokose akula kwayakoneka, na tutsomhulumkila ka litungwe pfalilaghala mna lidongo. Kuduhu iyatsolekighwa mgima, yawe yeye imwenyegho au iwanu wake. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Ka katsotsumila kuna ghumji ghumwe, baho maasikali wose wa Isiraeli watsoghala lutsabi kuna ghumji agho, na kughubuluta mbaka kulukolongo, na kuduhu hata libwe limwe litsolekighwa mlughongo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Absalomu na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli walonga, “Chayalongile Hushai chinogha kubita chayalongile Ahitofeli.” Kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakabama kutopfaghitsa achila ichinoghile chayalongile Ahitofeli, mana IMNDEWA tsakabama yamghalile ghehile Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kolongelighwa yatsume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Kuya Hushai kawalongela iwatambika Sadoki na Abiatari, “Ahitofeli kamlongela Absalomu na wanzehe wa Isiraeli watende aghano na aghano, lekeni nene niwalongela watende apfino na apfino. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Lelo nowalongela, mtumeni munu yakamlongele Daudi yaleke kuwasa hana ipfiloko ako kunyika chilo achino ila yaloke yoke, hela watsomghogha na kumkoma yeye na iwanu wake.”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonasani na Ahimaasi wang'ali wokalagha Eni Rogeli, ng'awabamile baye munu yawone hawakwingila mna ghumji. Mtumighwa yumwe pinga yang'ali yowangilagha na kuwalongela aghala igholawila, nawo wang'ali woghendagha kwa mfalume Daudi kumlongela. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Lekeni msongolo yumwenga tsakawona, kaghenda kumlongela Absalomu. Apfo Yonasani na Ahimaasi wasumkila kuna ing'anda ya munu yumwe ako Bahirimu. Yeye tsakana chisima kuna iluwa lwa ing'anda yake. Nawo wengila mghati mwa ichisima acho wepfisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Ipinga imwenye kaye ayo kasola chighubiko kaghubika ichisima acho, kuya kanika ngano mchanya mwake. Apfo haduhu iyamanyile ichinu acho. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Maasikali wa Absalomu hawapfikile kwa ipinga ayo, wamghutsa, “Ahimaasi na Yonasani walikwani?” Ipinga ayula kawedika, “Waloka ichikolongo cha ghamatsi.” Wawabama lekeni ng'awawonile baye, apfo woya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Maasikali wa Absalomu hawokile, Yonasani na Ahimaasi walawa mna ichisima, waghenda kwa mfalume Daudi kumlongela, walonga, “Ghenda ukaloke ghumto sambi baha kwaapfila Ahitofeli tsakalonga ghweghwe utendighwe apfino na apfino.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Apfo Daudi na iwanu wose iwali hamwe naye woka waloka ghumto ghwa Yoridani. Nemitondo hakuchele iwanu wose waloka ghumto Yoridani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahitofeli kekoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli hayonile chayalongile ng'awachitendile baye, kadina chihongwe wake, kaghenda ukaye kuna ghumji ghwake, kuko keka pfinu pfake ghoya, kuya kekoma kwa kwinyighinza. Kafa na katsikighwa hanu hayatsikighwe aba wake.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Daudi kapfika Mahanaimu. Naye Absalomu kaloka ghumto Yoridani hamwe na maasikali wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Ichipindi acho Absalomu kamwika Amasa yasole hanu ha Yoabu yawe mkulu wa maasikali, Amasa tsa mwana wa Yitira, kulawa lukolo lwa Ishimaeli. Mai wake Amasa tsakakemighwa Abigaili neghe Nahashi, na ayu Abigaili tsa lumbu wake Seruya, iyali mai wake Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Absalomu na maasikali wa Isiraeli tsaweka ndalo mna isi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi hayapfikile Mahanaimu, Shobi mwana wa Nahashi wa kabila lya Amoni, kulawa Raba, Makili mwana wa Amieli kulawa Lodebari, hamwe na Barizilai Mgileadi kulawa Rogelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />tsawaghala pfilagho, mabakuli, pfinongo, ngano, shayiri, utimbo, madanu, ng'unde na dengu, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />uki, siagi, wang'olo, na ghamapfuta gha iwanyama kulawa kuna imifugho yawo. Ipfinu apfo pfose wamghalila Daudi na iwanu iyakalile nawo, kwaapfila tsawalonga, “Iwanu awano wana nzala, wepfa na wana ng'ilu ako kunyika.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Absalomu kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi kawapeta maasikali wake, kawaghola wakale elufu elufu aku wolongotsighwa na iwakulu wawo, na wakale miya miya aku wolongotsighwa na iwakulu wawo.<verse eid="2SA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi kawaghola maasikali wake makingili madatu, wamwenga walongotsighwa na Yoabu, na wamwenga walongotsighwa na Abishai, mwana wa Seruya, ndughu yake Yoabu, na wangi walongotsighwa na Itai, Mgiti. Kuya mfalume Daudi kawalongela wose, “Nene nimwenyegho nitsoghenda na mwemwe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Lekeni maasikali wamlongela, “Ghweghwe uleke kulawa kunze kwa ghumji, kwaapfila tung'atsuma, wawo watsakwona si chinu baye. Na inusu ya wanu wetu wang'akomighwa wawo pfipfila watsakwona si chinu baye. Lekeni ghweghwe kuna samani ng'ulu kubita twetwe wanu elufu kumi. Apfo pfinogha ghweghwe usighale, na kutsotwapfila kulawa kuko kuna ghumji.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Mfalume Daudi kawalongela, “Chochose chamkona chinogha, nene nitsotenda.” Apfo, mfalume kema habehi na lilango aku maasikali wake wolawa kunze kwa miya miya, na kwa elufu elufu.<verse eid="2SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Mfalume Daudi kawalaghitsa Yoabu, Abishai na Itai, “Mtendeleni pfinoghile imsongolo Absalomu, kwaajili yangu.” Maasikali wose tsawamuhulika mfalume hayang'ali yowalaghitsa iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo, wamtendele pfinoghile Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Apfo maasikali wa Daudi waghenda kunyika, wetowa na iwanu wa Isiraeli kuna muhulo ghwa Efuraimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Imaasikali wa Daudi wawatowa maasikali wa Absalomu. Wanu wengi tsawakomighwa mna litsuwa alyo, na wanu elufu ishilini wakomighwa. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Ing'ondo ayo yenela muisi yose, na iwanu iwafile kwa ukughaya mna ghumhulo tsawengi kubita awala iwakomighwe na lipanga.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Kuya Absalomu aku kakwila ipunda falasi wake, ketingana na watumighwa wa Daudi. Imnyama ayo hayabitile hasi ha maputila makulu gha mbiki mkulu ghwa mwaloni, baho litwi lya Absalomu lifang'ama mna ghumwaloni. Absalomu kalekighwa kolebela aku ipunda falasi wake yang'ali yoghendelela hambele.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Munu yumwenga kamwona, apfo kaghenda kumlongela Yoabu, “Nimwona Absalomu kolebela kuna ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu kamlongela imunu ayo, “Choni? Kumwona Absalomu? Hebali ng'umtowile mbaka yaghwe hasi baye? Tsaning'akwing'ile fetsa shekeli kumi na msipi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Lekeni imunu ayula kamlongela Yoabu, “Hata ka ung'angaile pfihande elufu imwe pfa fetsa tsa sigholosa baye ghumoko nimtowe imwana wa mfalume. Kwaapfila tsatumuhulika hayang'ali yokulaghitsa ghweghwe, Abishai na Itai, hayalongile, ‘Mleke kumlagha imsongolo Absalomu.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Ka ning'alekile kumtegheletsa mfalume na kumkoma imwanaghe, yeye yang'amanyile chila chinu kwaapfila kuduhu chochose ichipfisika kuna yeye, hata ghweghwe ghumwenyegho ung'anihunduke.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu kamlongela, “Nene sidaha kughendelela kulonga naghwe baye.” Baho Yoabu kasola migoha midodo midatu kaghenda kumhoma Absalomu mna ghumoyo. Yoabu hayaghendile kumhoma, kampfika Absalomu yang'ali mgima na kolebela mna liputila lya ghumwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Kuya iwasongolo kumi iwaghalile tsisilaha tsa Yoabu, wamtsunguluka Absalomu, wamtowa na wamalitsila ukumkoma.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Apfo Yoabu katowa malati na maasikali wose woya, kwaapfila Yoabu kawaghoma waleke kuwawinza Waisiraeli.<verse eid="2SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Walusola ilukuli lwa Absalomu walwasa mna lipondo kulu kumhulo, kuya walulundikila lundo kulu lya mabwe. Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli watsuma, chila munu ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha ugima wake, Absalomu tsakasimika ngutso yake mna lwanda lwa mfalume, kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Nene nahela mwana mmale wa kughendeletsa taghwa lyangu ili wang'umbuke.” Ingutso ayo tsakaing'a taghwa lyake, mbaka leloli yokemighwa, “Ngutso ya Absalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kolongelighwa ukufa kwa Absalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Kuya Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki kamlongela Yoabu, “Leka nitsume kwa mfalume nikamlongele ka IMNDEWA kamkombola kulawa kwa maadui tsake.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Naye Yoabu kamlongela, “Leloli ng'ughenda baye kumlongela imbuli ayo. Kodaha kumlongela imbuli ayo tsuwa lingi, lekeni si leloli baye, kwaapfila imwana wa mfalume kakomighwa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Apfo Yoabu kamlongela munu yungi Mkushi, “Ghweghwe ghenda ukamlongele mfalume aghala ghowonile.” Mkushi kamwinamila Yoabu kuya katsuma koka.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Kuya Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki kamlongela keli Yoabu, “Leka lyolyose lilawile, nokulomba undeke nimtsumile Mkushi ayula!” Yoabu kamlongela, “Mwanangu, hebali ubama utsume? Ghweghwe ng'utsopata chinu chochose baye kwa imbuli ayo yaubama kughala!”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi kamwidika, “Ghweghwe leka lyolyose lilawile, nene notsuma.” Apfo Yoabu kamlongela, “Tsuma uke!” Baho Ahimaasi katsuma kang'ila inzila ya kunyika kambita Mkushi ayula.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Daudi tsakakala haghatighati ha ghamalango gha ghumji, lya mghati na lya kunze. Na imkalitsi wa lilango tsakadina mchanya mwa ubanda. Hayenule tsinenge tsake yalole, kona imunu kayeka kotsuma. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Imkalitsi ayo kamlongela mfalume imbuli ayo kwa kukemelela. Naye mfalume kedika kalonga, “Ka kayeka kana mbuli inoghile ya kutulongela.” Imunu ayula kaghendelela kusoghela habehi.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Imkalitsi kamwona keli munu yungi kotsuma, kamkemelela mkalitsi wa lilango kamlongela, “Lola munu yungi kotsuma yaliyeka!” Baho mfalume kalonga, “Naye pfipfila koghala mbuli inoghile ya kutulongela.” <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Mkalitsi ayula kalonga keli, “Nakona ayula iyamlongolele miyaghe kotsuma ka Ahimaasi imwana wa Sadoki.” Mfalume kalonga “Imunu ayo kanogha, kotughalila mbuli inoghile.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ahimaasi kamdalamkila mfalume, kalonga, “Chila chinu chinogha.” Kenama hambele ha mfalume mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi, kalonga, “Yenulighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, iyakukombole kulawa kwa iwanu awala iwenule ghamoko ghawo wakutowe ghweghwe, mkulu wangu mfalume.” <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Pfihi imsongolo Absalomu kamgima?” Ahimaasi kedika, “Yoabu hayanitumile nene mtumighwa wako tsambona tsogho kulu lekeni tsasimanyile baye kulawile choni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Wime aho hambalimbali.” Apfo Ahimaasi kasoghela hambalimbali, kema baho.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Kuya Mkushi ayula kapfika naye kalonga, “Mkulu wangu mfalume, tegheletsa mbuli inoghile kulawa kuna nene. Leloli IMNDEWA kakukombola kulawa kwa awala wose iwenuke wakutowe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Mfalume kamghutsa, “Pfihi imsongolo Absalomu kamgima?” Mkushi kalonga, “Maadui tsako, ghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, na wose iwakwinuka wakutendele ghehile, nabama nene chiwalawile achila ichimlawile imsongolo Absalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Babo mfalume kona usungu sideke, kadina kuna ichiheleto ichikalile mchanya mwa lilango lya kujilo. Hayang'ali yodina yang'ali yolila na kulonga, “Wenye ghwe! Mwanangu Absalomu! Ghwe mwanangu! Mwanangu Absalomu! Ng'apfu ning'afile nene, ghweghwe ukale! Wenye ghwe, Absalomu mwanangu! Mwanangu ghwe!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu kommanila mfalume Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu kahulika ka mfalume yang'ali yolila na kudomboketsa kwa ukufa kwa Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Litsuwa alyo ukudeng'elela kwa maasikali kwa ukuhuma kung'ondo kughaluka kuwa chililo, kwaapfila tsawahulika ka mfalume yang'ali yomlilila Absalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Apfo litsuwa alyo iwanu woya mna ghumji tulu tulu ka iwanu iwakuya mna ghumji aku wakona chinyala kwa kuwingighwa kung'ondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mfalume Daudi keghubika ichihanga chake aku kolila, “Ghwe mwanangu Absalomu, ghwe mwanangu Absalomu, ghwe mwanangu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Yoabu kengila ukaye kwa mfalume kalonga, “Leloli ipfihanga pfetu tukwika kwani, kwa ichinyala achino chatupatile twetwe watumighwa wako, yatuukombole ugima wako, na ugima wa iwanu wako wamale na wapinga, na ugima wa wehe tsako, na ugima wa mapinga wako wadodo. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Ghweghwe kowakunda awala iwokuhila na kowahila awala iwokukunda. Leloli kutulangusa bila kupfisa ka iwakulu wa ing'ondo, na iwatumighwa wako wose si chinu baye kuna ghweghwe. Nakona ghendo ka Absalomu yang'awile mgima leloli, na ka twetwe wose tufa, ghweghwe ung'adeng'elele. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Lelo winuke ughende ukalonge lughalugha na watumighwa wako, kwaapfila nelaha kwa IMNDEWA, ka ng'ughenda baye ukalonge nawo, kuduhu hata munu yumwe iyatsokala na ghweghwe ichilo achino. Achi chitsakuwa chinu chihile ghendo kuna ghweghwe kubita ighehile ghose ighakupatile kulawa usongolo wako mbaka leloli.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Kuya mfalume kalawa kaghenda kakala hanu hake hana lilango. Iwanu wose hawahulike ka mfalume kakala hana lilango, wamghendela kulawa mmakaye mwawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Kwaapfila ichipindi acho iwanu wose wa Isiraeli tsawatsuma chila munu ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kakuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Iwanu wose mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli wang'ali wesonga wawo kwa wawo, walonga, “Mfalume Daudi katukombola kulawa kwa maadui tsetu, katukombola kulawa kwa Wafilisti. Lekeni sambi katsuma, kaileka isi kwa kuwingighwa na Absalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Na Absalomu yatumbakile mapfuta yawe mfalume wetu, kakomighwa kuna ing'ondo. Hebali sambi ng'atulonga chinu chochose baye mna imbuli ya ukumuyitsa mfalume Daudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Mfalume Daudi katuma nume kwa watambika Sadoki na Abiatari, “Walongeleni iwanzehe wa Yuda apfino, ‘Hebali wawo wawe wa kusa mna ukumuyitsa mfalume ukaye yake? Mana chawolonga Waisiraeli wose, sambi chinipfikila nene mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mwemwe mwa ndughu tsangu, mwemwe mwa imipate na inyama yangu, hebali lelo mwemwe mwa wa kusa ukumbuyitsa ukaye nene mfalume? <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Pfipfila mlongeleni Amasa, 'Ghwghwe kwa ndughu yangu wa damu. Imulungu yang'ome ghendo ka kulawa leloli sitsokusaghula ghweghwe baye uwe mkulu wa maasikali wangu, usole hanu ha Yaobu.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Apfo Daudi kaitenda imimoyo ya iwanu wa Yuda imtoghole yeye, nawo lyao liwa limwe. Apfo wamtumila nume, walonga “Uye ukaye ghweghwe na watumighwa wako wose.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Lelo mfalume kanza ukuya, na hayapfikile kuna ghumto Yoridani, iwanu wose wa Yuda waghenda Giligali kumbokela mfalume, kuya wamlosa mna ghumto Yoridani.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimei, mwana wa Gera, iyolawa Bahurimu mna likabila lya Benjamini, kahulumka himahima hamwe na iwanu wa Yuda kumbokela mfalume Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei kelongotsa na Wabenjamini elufu imwe hamwe na Siba mtumighwa mkulu wa kaye ya Sauli. Siba kaghenda na iwanaghe wamale kumi na watumighwa ishilini, waghenda himahima kuna ghumto Yoridani, hanu hayali mfalume Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Apfo waloka kuna ighumto, wawasindikitse iwanu wa ikaye ya mfalume, na kumtendela mfalume chila chinu chayabamile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Daudi komwonela libatsi Shimei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Mfalume hayalokile ghumto Yoridani, baho Shimei mwana wa Gera katsa, kafudabala hambele hake. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei kamlongela mfalume, “Nokulomba ghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, ughasemwe aghala ghanitendile litsuwa alila haulawile Yerusalemu uke. Uleke kugheka mna ghumoyo ghwako. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kwaapfila nene mtumighwa wako nimanya ka tsanitenda nzambi, apfo leloli nitsa niwe munu wa mwanduso mna likabila lya Yosefu kukubokela ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Baho Abishai mwana wa Seruya kalonga, “Shimei kobamighwa yakomighwe kwaapfila kamlighita imunu iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA yawe mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Lekeni Daudi kalonga, “Angu mwemwe wana wa Seruya, mna choni na nene? Leloli nene niwa keli mfalume wa Isiraeli. Apfo kuduhu munu wowose wa Isiraeli iyatsokomighwa leloli!”<verse eid="2SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Mfalume kamlongela Shimei aku kelaha, “Ghweghwe ng'utsokomighwa baye.”<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komwonela libatsi Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti, mtsukulu wa Sauli pfipfila kahulumka kaghenda kumbokela mfalume Daudi. Yeye ng'oghile baye, wala ng'aghetile baye tsindepfu tsake, wala ng'atsapfile baye ghamabwende ghake kulawa litsuwa alila mfalume hayokile Yerusalemu mbaka hayoyile mgima. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Hayapfikile kulawa Yerusalemu kumbokela mfalume, mfalume kamghutsa, “Mefibosheti, hebali ng'ughendile na nene baye?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti kedika, “Mkulu wangu mfalume, mtumighwa wangu tsakanighutsukila. Kwaapfila nene tsanimlongela, ‘Nitandikile ipfilagho mchanya mwa ichihongwe, nimdine, ng'ende na mfalume,’ kwaapfila nene mtumighwa wako na chimbete. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Lelo kanibangitsila kuna ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume. Lekeni ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, kweghala na malaika wa Imulungu. Tenda chochose chaukona chinogha. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Kwaapfila iwanu wose wa ikaye ya aba wangu tsawabamighwa wakomighwe ghendo hambele hako, mkulu wangu mfalume. Lekeni tsakunyika nene mtumighwa wako ng'ale hamwe na awala iwakuja hana imetsa yako. Angu nina choni mbaka nikulombe keli pfinu pfingi mfalume?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Hebali ulonga ghose agho. Nene ma nilamla ka ghweghwe na Siba mtsegholela isi ya Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Lekeni Mefibosheti kamlongela mfalume, “Mleke Siba yaisole isi yose iwe yake yaliyeka, kwaapfila chanibama nene, ukukwona ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume kuya ukaye kwa mgima.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komtendela Barizilai ighanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Barizilai, iyolawa isi ya Gileadi, ghumji ghwa Rogelimu, naye tsakahulumka kuna ghumto Yoridani. Tsakaghenda kumsindikitsa mfalume mbaka yaloke ghumto ghwa Yoridani. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Barizilai tsakalala ghendo, tsakana miyaka semanini, na tsakana mali nyingi sideke. Yeye tsa yuyo iyamwing'ile mfalume ipfijo hayakalile ako Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Lelo mfalume Daudi kamlongela Barizilai, “Tuke wose Yerusalemu, na nene nitsokutunza.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Lekeni Barizilai kamlongela mfalume, “Angu nene nina miyaka mingapi ya ukukala mgima mbaka ng'ende Yerusalemu na ghweghwe mfalume? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Leloli nene nina miyaka semanini. Apfi nodaha kutanga ighanoghile na aghala ighehile? Pfihi nodaha kutanga chanilanza hanikuja na ukunwa? Angu nodadaha kuwahulika iwamale au iwapinga hawakwimba? Hebali nene mtumighwa wako nikawe mtsigho ghungi kuna ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Nene mtumighwa wako nitsokusindikitsa chidogho kumwambu kwa Yoridani. Heule mfalume unigweka chinu chikulu apfino? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nokulomba undeka nene mtumighwa wako nikafile mna ghumji ghwangu habehi na likabuli lya aba wangu na mai wangu. Lekeni ayuno mtumighwa wako Kimihamu, mleke yaghende na ghweghwe mkulu wangu mfalume, na umtendele chochose chaukona chinogha.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Nene nitsoghenda na Kimihamu na nitsomtendela chochose ichinoghile. Na chochose chutsobama nikutendele, nitsokutendela.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Kuya iwanu wose hamwe na mfalume waloka ghumto Yoridani. Mfalume kamnonela, kambaliki Barizilai kuya Barizilai koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Yuda na iwanu wa Isiraeli wesongela mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Mfalume hayalokile yaghende Giligali, Kimihamu naye kaloka naye. Iwanu wose wa Yuda na nusu ya iwanu wa Isiraeli wang'ali womsindikitsa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Kuya iwanu wose wa Isiraeli tsawaghenda kwa mfalume wamlongela, “Hebali ndughu tsetu iwanu wa Yuda tsa wakusola chinyemela haung'ali kwamnzila na wakulosa ghweghwe mna ghumto Yoridani, hamwe na iwanu wa ikaye yako na iwanu wako wose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Iwanu wa Yuda wawedika iwanu wa Isiraeli, “Tutenda apfino kwaapfila mfalume ka ndughu yetu ghendo. Hebali mwoghudubuka kwa achino chatutendile? Pfihi tuja chinu chochose cha mfalume? Angu yeye katugweka chinu chochose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Iwanu wa Isiraeli wawedika iwanu wa Yuda, “Twetwe tuna haki mala kumi kubita yamwinayo mwemwe, pfipfila tuna chinu chikulu cha ukulonga kwa Daudi kubita mwemwe. Lelo hebali mtubetsile? Angu si twetwe baye twanzile kulonga mfalume wetu yoye.” Lekeni iwanu wa Yuda tsawalonga kwa ukukemba kubita apfila iwanu wa Isiraeli pfawalongile.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba kombiduka mfalume Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Apfo tsahana munu yehile iyakemighwe Sheba mwana wa Bikiri, wa likabila lya Benjamini iyang'ali yokala Giligali. Naye tsakatowa malati kalonga, “Twahela chetu kwa Daudi, twahela hanu hohose kuna imwana wa Yese, lelo mwemwe iwanu wa Isiraeli chila munu yaghende ukaye yake.” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Apfo iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wamleka Daudi wamuwinza Sheba imwana wa Bikiri. Lekeni iwanu wa Yuda wamng'ang'anila mfalume Daudi kulawa kuna ghumto Yoridani mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Daudi hayapfikile kuna ing'anda yake ya chifalume ako Yerusalemu, kawasola pinga wake watumwa kumi tsayawekile walolese ing'anda yake, kawahindila kuna ing'anda ingi ikalitsighwa, kaweng'a ghose ghawabamile lekeni ng'awasile nawo baye. Apfo wapinga awo wahindilighwa mng'anda mbaka ukufa kwao hakupfikile, tsawakala ka wapinga iwafilighwe na iwamale wawo.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela Amasa, “Nikemele iwanu wose wa Yuda watse ahano mna matsuwa aghano madatu na ghweghwe mwenyegho tsauwe baho.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Lelo Amasa kaghenda kuwakema maasikali wa Yuda. Lekeni ng'oyile baye mna ghamatsuwa aghala madatu ghayamlongele Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi kamlongela Abishai, “Lelo Sheba imwana wa Bikiri katsotughalila usungu kubita aula wa Absalomu. Wasole watumighwa wangu umuwinze Sheba hela katsakwingila mna imiji itsungulusighwe ubanda na tuleke kumwona keli.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai na maasikali wa Yoabu tsawoka, welongotsa na Wakereti, Wapeleti na maasikali wane ngupfu. Awo wose tsawaghenda Yerusalemu kumuwinza Sheba mwana wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Hawapfikile kuna libambalawe kulu lili Gibeoni, Amasa tsakaghenda kawabokela. Yoabu tsakapfala gwanda lya ng'ondo, na mghati mwa ligwanda alyo tsamna msipi ighukindilitse lipanga mna chuno chake na lipanga kalihomeka myala. Yoabu hayapfikile habehi, lipanga lyake lisomoka myala na lilaghala hasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu kamlongela Amasa, “Pfihi kwa mgima ndughu yangu?” Yoabu kamkinda Amasa mna ichidepfu kwa ghumoko ghwa kujilo ka kobama kumnonela. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Lekeni Amasa ng'atangile baye ka Yoabu tsakakinda lipanga mna ghumoko ghwake, apfo Yoabu kamuhoma Amasa munda kwa lipanga. Usapi ukilifuka kunze, bahala kafa. Yoabu ng'amuhomile lwakeli baye. Kuya Yoabu na Abishai waghendelela kumuwinzilitsa Sheba, mwana wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Munu yumwenga wa Yoabu kema habehi na ilukuli lwa Amasa kalonga, “Wowose iyomkunda Yoabu na wowose yomkunda Daudi yamuwinze Yoabu!”<verse eid="2SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa tsayang'ali kawasa mna idamu yake haghati ghati ha inzila ng'ulu. Apfo chila imunu iyabitile hala hayamwonile tsakema. Lekeni munu yumwe hayonile iwanu wose wakutsa wakwima ahala, kalulapfa ilukuli lwa Amasa mna inzila ng'ulu kalughala kubagho, kalughubika gholole. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa hayalapfighwe mna inzila ng'ulu, wanu wose waghendelela kughenda na Yoabu wamuwinza Sheba, mwana wa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba tsakabita mna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Abeli ya Beti Maaka. Iwanu wose wa lukolo lwa Bikiri nawo tsawetingana hamwe, wamuwinza Sheba.<verse eid="2SA 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Maasikali wose iwelongotse na Yoabu tsawapfika mna ghumji aghula ghwa Abeli wa Beti Maaka, wampfingilila Sheba. Watsenga masughulu hambele ha ghumji, nalyo tsalima lyelolesa kune ubanda, na iwanu wose tsawanza kubomola ubanda awo waughwise hasi.<verse eid="2SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Kuya ipinga yumwenga iyakengele kulawa mna ghumji kalila kalonga, “Tegheletseni! Tegheletseni! Mlongeleni Yoabu yatse nonge naye.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu kamsoghelela habehi, ipinga ayo kamghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe kwa Yoabu!” Yoabu kedika, “Ona” Ipinga ayula kamlongela “Nitegheletse nene mtumighwa wako.” Yoabu kumwidika “Longa nokutegheletsa.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Ghumwande iwanu wang'ali wolonga, ‘Ghendani Abeli mkaghutse pfamtsolamla lighomba.’ Apfo pfipfo iwanu pfawamalitse maghomba ghawo. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Nene na yumwe wa iwanu iwobama ukukala tseghamba na iwotogholighwa mna isi ya Isiraeli. Hebali ghweghwe kobama kughuinya mji mkulu ighuli ka mame mna Isiraeli? Hebali ghweghwe kobama kughumalitsa ghumji ghwa IMNDEWA?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu kamwidika, “Nene sibama ghendo baye ukutenda apfo, sibama baye kughutowa wala kughuhinya ghumji ghwako. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Si pfipfo baye! Lekeni hana munu yumwe iyokemighwa Sheba mwana wa Bikirimu kulawa isi ya ipfidunda ya Efraimu, komlema mfalume Daudi. Mlapfeni kuna nene, na nene nitsakuka mna ghumji ghwenu.” Ipinga ayula kamlongela Yoabu, “Watsokwasila litwi lyake kubitila mwibanda.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Kwa ukukengela kwake, ipinga ayo kaghenda kawalongela iwanu wose wa ghumji chawobamighwa ukutenda. Apfo iwanu walidumla litwi lya Sheba imwana wa Bikiri, kuya walyasa kunze kwa Yoabu. Apfo Yoabu katowa malati, kawapwililisa iwanu wake woke mna ghumji aghwo ghwa Abeli, na chila munu koya ukaye yake. Kuya Yoabu koya kwa mfalume Daudi mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwamwapfile Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoabu tsa mkulu wa maasikali wa Isiraeli, Banaya mwana wa Yehoyada tsa mkulu wa Wakeleti na Wapeleti, iwakalitsi wake Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoramu tsa mkulu wa sang'ano tsa kunanahitsighwa, Yehoshafati yang'ali yakwandika tsikumbukumbu. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shausha tsa mkulu wa ukwandika, Sadoki na Abiatari tsa watambika wa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ira kulawa ghumji ghwa Yairi pfipfila naye tsa mtambika wa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Sauli wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Tsakulawila nzala ng'ulu ya miyaka midatu mna ghamatsuwa ghayalongotse mfalume Daudi. Apfo Daudi tsakamlomba IMNDEWA, naye kamwidika kalonga, “Inzala ilawila kwaapfila Sauli na iwanu wa ikaye yake wonung'a idamu ya iwanu, wawo wawakoma Wagibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Wagibeoni tsa si wana wa Isiraeli baye, lekeni tsa watsukulu wa Waamoni iwawalekile. Waisiraeli tsawelighita ka ng'awatsowakoma baye, lekeni Sauli tsakabama kuwakoma, kwaapfila tsakabama isi yose iwe yawo iwanu wa Isiraeli na Yuda. Apfo mfalume Daudi kawakema Wagibeoni, kalonga nawo. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Kawaghutsa Wagibeoni, “Nimtendeleni choni ili iwanu wa IMNDEWA waleghusighwe inzambi aino kwa aghala ighehile ghamtendelighwe?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Wagibeoni wamwidika, “Twetwe ng'atubama baye munu wowose yatulihe fetsa wala nzahabu kwa lighomba lyetu na Sauli na iwanu wa ikaye yake, wala twetwe ng'atubama baye kumkoma munu wowose mna isi ya Isiraeli.” Mfalume kawaghutsa keli, “Angu lelo mwobama niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Wawo wamwidika imfalume, “Sauli tsakabama kutukoma twetwe, tuhupe ghendo na ng'abamile baye munu wowose mna twetwe yawe na hanu ha ukukala mna isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Lelo twing'e wanaghe saba iwamale tuwakome hambele ha IMNDEWA mna ichidunda cha Gibea, kuna ghumji ghwa Sauli, iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA.” Naye mfalume kawedika, “Nitsomwing'ani.” <verse eid="2SA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Lekeni mfalume ng'aweng'ile baye Mefibosheti mwana wa Yonasani, iyali mtsukulu wa Sauli, kwaapfila Daudi na Yonasani mwana wa Shauli tsaweka laghano hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Lekeni mfalume kawasola Arimoni na Mefibosheti, iwana weli wa Risipa neghe Ahiya, iyeleke na Sauli. Pfipfila kawasola iwana wose watano iwamale wa Mikali, neghe Sauli iyamwelekele Adirieli mwana wa Barizilai, Mmeholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Daudi kawaghala iwanu awo saba kwa Wagibeoni, nawo wawakondeka mna ichidunda habehi na hanu hawamtambikile IMNDEWA. Wose saba wafa hamwe. Wawakoma iwanu awo mna ghamatsuwa gha ukwanza ukupfuna ishayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Kuya Rispa neghe Ahiya, kasola maghunila katandika mna libambalawe. Kakala aho tangiya msimu ghwa ukupfuna haghwanzile mbaka msimu ghwa imvula haghupfikile, nayo imvula iwatowela iwanu awo iwafile. Matsuwa agho ghose yang'ali yowawinga wapfideghe na iwanyama wa kwibagho chilo na misi waleke kupfika hana iwanu iwafile.<verse eid="2SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi hayahulike aghala ghayatendile Risipa neghe Ahiya, pinga mdodo wa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />kaghenda kuisola imipate ya Sauli na Yonasani, imwanaghe, kulawa kuna iwanu wa Yabeshi Gileadi, iwebile imipate ayo kulawa hana ichibwalu cha ukwitinganila iwanu wose ako Beti Shani, hanu wafilisti hawawakondeke Sauli na Yonasani mna litsuwa alila Wafilisti hawamkomile Sauli kuchidunda cha Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Apfo Daudi kayuitsa imipate ya Sauli na mwanaghe Yonasani, kuya wasola imipate ya iwanu saba iwakondekighwe. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Kuya iwanu wa Daudi waitsika imipate ya Sauli na Yonasani, imwanaghe, mna Isi ya Benjamini, mna likabuli lya Kishi aba wake Sauli ako Sela. Tsawatenda chila chinu chayawalaghitse mfalume. Haghamalile agho, Imulungu kahulika ichililo cha isi yawo.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maasikali wa Daudi wetowa na Wafilisti mitsinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 20:4-8">1 Sam 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Wafilisti waghenda kwitowa keli na Waisiraeli. Daudi na iwanu wake wahulumka waghenda kwitowa nawo. Kuko Daudi tsakepfa sideke.<verse eid="2SA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Tsinu limwe likemighwe Ishibi Benobu, kulawa mna ilukolo lwa Warefai, tsakana mgoha ghuna utsito wa kilo ndatu na nusu, na tsayeyohile lipanga lya sambi, kalonga yang'amkomile Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Lekeni Abishai mwana wa Seruya kaghenda kumwapfila Daudi. Abishai kamtowa Mfilisti ayula mbaka kamkoma. Apfo iwanu wa Daudi welaha hambele hake walonga, “Ghweghwe ng'utsoghenda keli na twetwe baye kung'ondo, ng'atubama baye itala ya Isiraeli itsimike.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Haghamale agho kulawila keli ng'ondo na Wafilisti ako Gobu. Baho Sibekai, Mhushati kamkoma Safu, wa ilukolo lwa Warefai, imitsinu.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Waisiraeli tsawetowa keli na Wafilisiti ako Gobu. Naye Elihanani mwana wa Yaareo Regimu, Mbetilehemu kamkoma Goliati, iyolawa Gati iyana mgoha ka mfundatsi ghwa chinanda.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Hambele chidogho Waisiraeli wetowa na Wafilisti ako Gati, tsahana tsinu tali lina pfidole sita chila ghumoko, na pfidole sita chila mghulu, pfosepfose pfidole ishilini na pfine. Pfipfila yeye tsakalawa mna ilukolo lwa Warefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Ayo kawaligha Waisiraeli, apfo Yonasani mwana wa Shama ndughu yake Daudi kamkoma.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Wose awo wane tsawalawa mna liukolo lwa Warefai ako Gati, nawo wakomighwa na Daudi hamwe na maasikali wake.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18">Zab 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi kamwimbila IMNDEWA wila auno mna litsuwa alila ahala IMNDEWA hayakombole kulawa mna maadui tsake na kulawa mna Ghamoko gha Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Tsakemba, IMNDEWA ka bambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ngome yangu na mkombola wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Imulungu wangu ka bambalawe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">kuna yeye nene notsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ngawo yangu, membe ya ukombotsi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Kuna yeye nene nepfisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">kuna yeye nene notsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">yeye mkombotsi wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">konikombola kulawa kwa iwanu waghobo.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nokukemelela ghweghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">ghweghwe yutunyighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">Unikombole kulawa kwa maandui tsangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Mana ghamawimbi gha ichifo tsaghanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">ghamafuriko ighehile ghanitenda nipfuke.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Mitsabi ya kutsimu tsa initsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">imitegho ya ichifo tsainitsila.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mna ukughanzika kwangu nimkemelela IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">tsanimkemelela Imulungu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kulawa kuna ing'anda yake kahulika litsi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">maghutwi ghake ghahulika ghendo ichililo changu.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Baho isi yose ighudema, ihighisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">imikwalambatsa ya kulanga nayo ihighisika, ighudema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">kwaapfila Imulungu kaghudubuka.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Liyosi lidusuka kulawa mna tsimula tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">lilambi ililakatsa lilawa mna ghumlomo ghwake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">ghamakala gha ghumoto ghatananuka kulawa kuna ghumlomo ghwake.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Kadegha lilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">kahulumka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">na libingu titu likala hasi ha ghamaghulu ghake.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Kakwila mna ichiumbe iyakemighwe kelubi, kaghuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">na koneka mna libeho ka kana mabawa.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Chisi chikulu chimghubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">ghamabingu matsito ghana ghamatsi pfaghoghubika kulanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lumwesa lulawila hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">na lilambi lilawila mna ghamakala gha ghumoto.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />IMNDEWA kaduma kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">litsi lya ayula iyali kuchanya ng'ani lihulikika.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Kawasila imishale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">kawapwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">na ilumwesa lwake nalwo luwatenda watsume.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />IMNDEWA hayawakembele, kwa muhe ghwa tsimula tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kuhisihisi ghendo kwa ibahali kughubulighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">na imikwalambatsa ya isi yoneka.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Yeye Imulungu kahulumka hasi kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kanikinda kwa ghumoko ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kanipfabula kulawa mna ghamatsi ighaghendese.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Kanikombola kulawa kuna adui yangu yana ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">na kulawa kwa awala iwanihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">kwaapfila wawo tsawana ngupfu kubita nene.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Haning'ali nighaya wawo wanipfingilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">lekeni yeye IMNDEWA yuyo iyanikingile.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Kanisola kanyika hanu hana ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">kanikombola kwaapfila yeye konoghelwa na nene.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />IMNDEWA kanighweka kwa kulola aghala ighanoghile ghanitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">na kangaya kwa kulola apfila ghamoko ghangu pfaghelile.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kwaapfila tsaniwinza malaghitso gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">wala sitendile ghehile baye kwa ukumleka Imulungu.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Tsang'inda malaghitso ghake ghose, wala silekile baye kukinda imiko yake.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Tsanikala nahela totso hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">tsanikinga nimwenyegho ndeke kutenda ghehile.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />IMNDEWA kanighweka kwa kulola aghala ighanoghile ghanitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">kwaapfila tsakambona nene nyela hambele ha tsinenge tsake.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Ghweghwe kotogholighwa kwa awala iwotogholighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">kunogha kwa awala iwanoghile.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Ghweghwe kwenzeluka kwa awala iwenzeluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">lekeni iwanu iwehile ng'uwonela libatsi baye.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Ghweghwe kowakombola iwanu ing'aweghoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">lekeni nenge tsako tsowalolesa iwanu iweghoda uwahulumse hasi.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Ghweghwe, IMNDEWA kwa tala yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">komwemwesa hana ichisi changu.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa ingupfu yaungaya, nene nowatowa maadui tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">kwa ingupfu ya Imulungu wangu, nene nodaluka ubanda.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Chochose chautenda ghweghwe Imulungu chinogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">ghaulonga ghose gholongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">ghweghwe kwa ngawo kwa awala wose iwokutsumilila.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Lelo nani iyali Imulungu ka si yeye IMNDEWA baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Nani iyali bambalawe lya ugima ka si yeye Imulungu wetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Imulungu yuyo ngome yangu ina ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">naye koitenda inzila yangu iwe na ugima.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Koitenda imighulu yangu iwe na ngupfu ka mighulu ya dondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na konitenda nime ghendo mna ipfidunda.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Konifunda ukwitowa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">na ghamoko ghangu ghadaha ukukwegha iminde ya shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Kungaya ingawo yako ya ukombotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">kunitenda nene niwe mkulu kwa apfila pfaunyapfile.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Kuitenda inzila yangu iwe ghatsi, wala ghamaghulu ghangu ng'aghateletse baye.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Niiwainzilitsa maadui tsangu na kuwakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">sibwelile baye kuchughu mbaka hanimalitse ukuwakoma wose.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Niwadugha ghendo, na waghwa hasi ha ghamaghulu ghangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">Na ng'awadahile baye ukwinuka keli.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Kungaya ingupfu ya ukwitowa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">na kuwatenda maadui tsangu wanyinamile.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Kuwatenda maadui tsangu watsume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">niwakoma awala wose iwanyihile.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Tsawambama imunu wa kuwapfila lekeni tsakuduhu imunu wa kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">wamkemelela IMNDEWA lekeni ng'awedike baye.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Niwahonda honda wawa ka timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">na niwabayugha ka kododo lili mnzila.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Kunikombola kulawa kwa iwanu wangu iwanilemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">kunisaghula niwalongotse iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">iwanu yang'asiwamanyile sambi wonisang'anila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Iwagheni hawahulike tsimbuli tsangu watsa kwinama hambele hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">nawo wanitegheletsa.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Wose tsawatenyuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">walawa kuna tsingome tsawo, watsa kuna nene aku woghudema.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />IMNDEWA ka mghima! Yatunyighwe bambalawe lyangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Yenulighwe Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">bambalawe linikombole.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Yeye yuyo iyowoyitsila ghehile iwanu awala iwanitendele ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">yeye yuyo iyoweka iwanu wa isi tsingi wawe hasi hangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Kanikombola kulawa kwa maadui tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">kunyinula mchanya mwa awala iwonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">na kunikombola kulawa kwa iwanu iwaghobo.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Apfo ghweghwe, ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">nitsokutunya kuna iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">nitsakwimba nilitunye litaghwa lyako.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Yeye komwaapfila mfalume wake yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">yeye komtendelela uluso mbakighwa mapfuta wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">Ona, komtendela uluso Daudi na ilukolo lwake lwose matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Daudi wa ukumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Daudi mwana wa Yese imunu iyatendighwe na Imulungu yawe mkulu, iyabakighwe ghamapfuta na Imulungu wa Yakobo. Waisiraeli wang'ali wodeng'elela ukwimba wila tsake. Apfo Daudi kamalitsa kwa ukwimba wila auno:<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Muhe wa IMNDEWA tsakalonga kubitila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">na malonga ghake kagheka mna ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Imulungu wa Isiraeli kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">bambalawe lya Isiraeli kanilongela:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">“Mfalume iyowatawala iwanu pfaibamighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">iyotawala aku kompfuka Imulungu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />yeye pfayali ka ghumwanga ghwa nemitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">na litsuwa ililawa nemitondo lilihela bingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">na ka imvula itenda imitsani yote.”<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Apfo pfipfo pfaili ing'anda yangu hambele ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">kwa apfila katenda laghano na nene ilikala matsuwa ghose, na laghano ing'alighaluka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Naye katsongaya chochose chanibama.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Lekeni iwanu iwehile weghala na tsimiwa itsikwasighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">kwaapfila ng'atsidaha baye ukusolighwa na ghumoko.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Imunu iyatsotsisola kobamighwa yatumile chuma au mhini ghwa mgoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Iwanu awo watsolakatsighwa ghendo mna ghumoto.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maasikali wadatu wa Daudi iwadahile kwitowa ghoya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Mmats 11:10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Aghano ghaho mataghwa gha wakulu wa ing'ondo wayakalile nawo Daudi: Yoshebu Bashebeti na Mtakimoni iyakalile chilongotsi wa awala wadatu, yeye tsaketowa kwa mgoha ghwake na kakoma wanu miya nane mna ng'ondo imwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Imunu wa keli kulawa mna maasikali awo wadatu, tsa Eleazari mwana wa Dodo, wa lukolo lwa Mwahohi. Tsuwa limwe Eleazari na Daudi wawaligha Wafilisti iwetingane wetowe nawo. Baho Waisiraeli wawatsuma Wafilisti, <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />lekeni Eleazari kaghangamala ghendo ketowa na Wafilisti mbaka ghumoko ghwake ghwipfa ghendo mbaka ghubemba, na ghukala ghukindilisa lipanga lyake. Mna litsuwa alyo IMNDEWA kahuma ghendo. Kuya Waisiraeli woya hanu hayakalile Eleazari, wasola ipfinu pfawawabokile Wafilisti iwakomighwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Mkulu wa ing'ondo wa kadatu, yuyo Shama mwana wa Agee iyalawile mna ghumji ghwa Harari. Tsuwa limwe Wafilisti wetingana Lehi hana ghumghunda ighumemile idengu, nawo Waisiraeli wawatsuma Wafilisti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Lekeni yeye kema ghoya haghati ghati ha ghumghunda ketowa nawo waleke kughusola ghumghunda aghwo, naye kawakoma Wafilisti. Apfo IMNDEWA kahuma ghendo.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Kuya wakulu wadatu mna iwakulu selasini wa ing'ondo, wamghendela Daudi kuna imango ya Adulamu mna msimu ghwa ukupfuna, nawo Wafilisti tsaweka ndalo kuna lwanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Chipindi achila Daudi tsakakala kuna ingome na maasikali wa Wafilisti tsawakala mna ghumji ghwa Betilehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi kona ng'ilu ghendo kalonga, “Munu yang'angayile ghamatsi gha ukunwa kulawa kuna ichisima cha Betilehemu ichili habehi na lilango lya ghumji!”<verse eid="2SA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Iwakulu awala wadatu webemenyeka wapfosa haghatighati hana indalo ya maasikali wa Wafilisti waghenda kudegha ghamatsi kuna ichisima cha Betilehemu habehi na lilango lya ghumji, wamghalila Daudi. Lekeni Daudi kalema ukughanwa, naye kaghakutula hasi ka nambiko kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Kalonga, “Sidaha baye ukunwa ghamatsi aghano, ghwe IMNDEWA! Angu ghamatsi aghano si ka idamu ya awala iwehonzile iwenyegho wakomighwe?” Apfo Daudi ng'anwele baye ghamatsi agho. Agho ghagho ghawatendile iwakulu awala wadatu wa ing'ondo.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai ndughu yake Yoabu tsakakala mkulu wa maasikali awala selasini. Tsakawakoma wanu miya ndatu na mgoha ghwake. Apfo tsakamanyika ka pfawamanyike iwakulu wa ing'ondo awala wadatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Tsakamanyika ng'ani kwa wakulu wa ing'ondo awala wadatu, na tsakawa chilongotsi wawo, lekeni tsang'amanyike baye ka awala wadatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Kabizeeli tsakakala asikali mkulu yane ngupfu na katenda pfinu pfingi pfa ukukangawatsa. Tsakawakoma maasikali weli kulawa Moabu, na chipindi cha ibalafu kahulumka mna lipondo kamkoma simba.<verse eid="2SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Pfipfila kalikoma tsinu lya Misiri ilikindile mgoha, lekeni Benaya tsakaghenda na ng'weku iliyeka, kamboka mgoha agho, kamkoma nagho. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Apfo pfipfo pfayatendile Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, tsakawa asikali mkulu mna awala wadatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Lelo tsakawa munu iyomanyika mna maasikali awala selasini hata ka ng'awile ka awala wadatu. Na Daudi kamtenda yawe mkulu wa maasikali wake mwenyegho. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Asaheli ndughu yake Yoabu tsakakala yumwe wa iwakulu selasini. Iwakulu wangi wa Daudi wawo awano: Elihanani, mwana wa Dodo wa Betilehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama na Elika kulawa Harodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi kulawa Paliti, Ira mwana wa Ikeshi kulawa Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeri kulawa Anatoti, Mebunai kulawa Hushati, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salimoni kulawa Ahohi, Maharai kulawa Netofati, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwana wa Baana kulawa Netofati, Itai mwana wa Ribai kulawa Gibea mna isi ya Benjamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya, kulawa Piratoni, Hidai kulawa pfikolongo pfa Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni kulawa Araba, Azimaweti kulawa Bahurimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba, kulawa Shaaliboni wana wa Yasheni, na Yonasani. <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Pfipfila Shama kulawa Harari, Ahimu mwana wa Sharari, kulawa Harari, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana wa Ahasibahi kulawa Maaka, Eliamu mwana wa Ahitofeli kulawa Gilioni, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hesirawi kulawa Karimeli, Paarai kulawa Mwaribi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwana wa Natani kulawa Msoba, Bani kulawa Gadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki kulawa Amoni, Naharai kulawa Beeroti iyang'ali yoghala tsisilaha tsa Yoabu imwana wa Seruya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira na Gerebu iwolawa Yatiri, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na uria iyolawa Hiti. Maasikali wose iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya tsa selasini na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowapeta Waisiraeli na Wayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Mmats 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila keli Waisiraeli, apfo kamsongetsa Daudi yawatende waghaye. Kamlongela yawapete Waisiraeli na iwanu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Apfo Mfalume kamlongela Yoabu na pfilongotsi wa maasikali iwakalile hamwe naye, “Ghendeni kuna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli kulawa Dani ili Kasikazini mbaka Beeri Sheba ili Kusini mkawapete iwanu ili nimanye ka wali wangapi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Lekeni Yoabu kamlongela mfalume, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako yawongetse Waisiraeli mala miya kubita pfawali sambi, naghwe mkulu wangu mfalume kutsowona apfila pfawakongetseka kwa nenge tsako mwenyegho. Lekeni hebali ghweghwe IMNDEWA wangu mfalume kobama kutenda ichinu achino?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Lekeni chayalongile mfalume tsa china ngupfu ng'ani kuna iwakulu wa maasikali. Lelo Yoabu na iwakulu wa maasikali wamleka mfalume waghenda kuwapeta Waisiraeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Waloka ghumto Yoridani wandusa kuwapeta iwanu tangiya Aroeri, ghumji ighuli haghati ha ulwanda, mna isi ya Gadi. Kulawa baho waghenda mbaka Yazeri. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Pfipfila waghenda isi ya Gileadi na Kadeshi mna isi ya Wahiti. Kuya wapfika Dani, na hawalawile Dani watsunguluka waghenda Sidoni.<verse eid="2SA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Kuya waghenda kuna ingome ya ghumji ghwa Tiro, wengila mna imiji yose ya Wahivi na ya Wakanaani. Kuya walawa waghenda isi ya Kusini ya Yuda ako Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Hawamalitse ukwanga mna isi yose, woya Yerusalemu ahala haimalile miyetsi tisa na matsuwa ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Kuya Yoabu kamghalila mfalume iwamale iwodaha ukwitowa ng'ondo iyawapetile. Mna isi ya Isiraeli tsakuna wamale laki nane, na mna isi Yuda tsakuna wamale laki tano.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Lekeni Daudi hayamalitse ukuwapeta iwanu ghumoyo ghwake ghumtama sideke. Apfo kamlongela IMNDEWA, “Nitenda nzambi ng'ulu kwa achila chanitendile. Lekeni sambi nokulomba ghwe IMNDEWA unileghusile nzambi nene mtumighwa wako, kwaapfila chinu chanitendile cha ubotsi ghendo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Ilupfi yake nemitondo Daudi hayalamke, IMNDEWA kamlongela Gadi nabii wa Daudi kalonga, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Ghenda ukamlongele Daudi apfino IMNDEWA kalonga apfino, ‘Nokwing'a pfinu pfidatu naghwe usaghule chimwe nani nitsokutendela.’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Apfo Gadi kamghendela Daudi kalonga, “Pfihi kobama nzala ya miyaka midatu ingile mna isi yako? Au uwingighwe na aduwi tsako kwa miyetsi midatu? Au kuwe na matamu kwa matsuwa madatu? Lelo usaghule chimwe kuya unongele ng'amlongele yanitumile.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi kamwidika Gadi, “Nina maghoyo makulu! Ng'apfu nitowighwe na IMNDEWA kwaapfila yeye kana libatsi kubita ukughoghighwa na iwanu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghalila matamu Waisiraeli, tangiya nemitondo mbaka chipindi chiyekile, na wanu elufu sabini wafa kulawa Dani mbaka Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Lekeni malaika hayagholose ghumoko ghwake ili yaghuhinye ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, IMNDEWA kaleka ukutenda aghala ghayabamile ukutenda. Kamlongela imalaika ayo, “Leka! Uleke kutenda agho ghaubama ukutenda” Litsuwa alyo imalaika tsakema habehi na ichibwalu cha ukubetela ingano cha Arauna wa likabila lya Wayebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi hayamwonile imalaika ayo iyang'ali yowakoma iwanu, kamlongela IMNDEWA, “Nene yuyo yanina inzambi na ghamatotso! Iwanu awano wahole, ng'awatendile ghehile baye. Nokulomba unitowe nene na iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Litsuwa lilyo Gadi kamghendela Daudi kamlongela “Ugheluke kuchanya mna ichibwalu cha ukubetela ingano cha Arauna Muyebusi ukamtsengele IMNDEWA matsabahu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Apfo Daudi kagheluka kuchanya ka pfayalongelighwe na Gadi, na ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arauna hayalolile lwehisi kamwona mfalume hamwe na watumighwa wake womtsila, naye kalawa kaghenda kamwinamila mbaka ichihanga chake chidonza hasi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Kuya Arauna kamghutsa mfalume, “Hebali mkulu wangu mfalume kanitsila nene mtumighwa wake?” Daudi kamwidika, “Nitsa kughula ichibwalu chako cha kubetela ili nimtsengele IMNDEWA matsabahu, na utamu uhupe ghendo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Naye Arauna kamlongela Daudi, “Mkulu wangu mfalume usole chochose chaukona chinogha umlapfile nambiko IMNDEWA. Nene nowalapfa wang'ombe awano wawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa, na ipfinu apfino pfa ukubetela na tsinila tsa wang'ombe tsiwe tsingodi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Apfo pfose nokwing'a ghweghwe mfalume. Nololela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako katsoitoghola inambiko yako.<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Lekeni mfalume kamlongela Arauna, “Baye! Ghweghwe uleke kungaya hela chochose. Nene nitsoghula kuna ghweghwe kwa bei yake. Sidaha baye ukumlapfila IMNDEWA wangu nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa bila kuliha chinu.” Apfo mfalume kaghula ichibwalu acho cha ukubetela na wang'ombe kwa pfihande pfa fetsa hamsini.<verse eid="2SA 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Kuya Daudi kamtsengela IMNDEWA matsabahu hanu aho na kamlapfila nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa na nambiko ya ukukala tseghamba. Apfo IMNDEWA katoghola aghala ghayamlombile na utamu aula uhupa ghendo mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>